window.QBANK={"ch": [["ch01", "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"], ["ch02", "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"], ["ch03", "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"], ["ch04", "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"], ["ch05", "第 5 章　函數"], ["ch06", "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"], ["ch07", "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"], ["ch08", "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"], ["ch09", "第 9 章　模板與泛型"], ["ch10", "第 10 章　課程總結：從語法到量化程式庫"]], "q": [{"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-1-1", "sid": "s1-1", "sec": "1.1 C++ 是什麼", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "C++ 的由來", "stem": "<p>C++ 是以哪一個語言為基礎發展出來的？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>C，再加入類別、模板等功能</p>"], ["B", "<p>Java，再加入指標功能</p>"], ["C", "<p>Python，再加入編譯功能</p>"], ["D", "<p>Fortran，再加入物件導向</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>C，再加入類別、模板等功能</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>C++ 由 Bjarne Stroustrup 在 C 的基礎上加入類別、模板、運算子多載等功能；C 可視為 C++ 的子集合。Java、Python 都比 C++ 晚出現。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-1-2", "sid": "s1-1", "sec": "1.1 C++ 是什麼", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "現代 C++", "stem": "<p>一般所說的「現代 C++」是從哪一個版本開始？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>C++11</p>"], ["B", "<p>C++03</p>"], ["C", "<p>C++98</p>"], ["D", "<p>C++20</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>C++11</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>C++11 是一次大改版（auto、範圍 for、智慧指標、lambda 等），之後的版本一般都稱為現代 C++；C++98/03 稱為傳統 C++。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-1-3", "sid": "s1-1", "sec": "1.1 C++ 是什麼", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "為什麼金融用 C++", "stem": "<p>用自己的話說明：為什麼量化金融的計算核心（例如定價、風險引擎）常用 C++ 撰寫？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>C++ 是編譯式語言，編譯後直接變成機器碼執行，速度比直譯式語言快很多；又能控制記憶體使用，適合大量重複的數值計算（例如對大量部位、大量情境重新評價、蒙地卡羅模擬）。它也有成熟的金融程式庫 QuantLib 和數值程式庫（Eigen、Boost），並能用類別與模板把金融商品、定價方法整理成結構清楚的大型程式。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-2-1", "sid": "s1-2", "sec": "1.2 編譯式語言：和 R、Python 有什麼不同", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "編譯式語言", "stem": "<p>關於 C++ 是「編譯式語言」，下列敘述何者正確？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>程式會一行一行邊翻譯邊執行，不會產生執行檔</p>"], ["B", "<p>編譯只會檢查縮排，型別錯誤要執行時才會發現</p>"], ["C", "<p>程式寫完不用任何處理，作業系統可以直接讀 .cpp 檔</p>"], ["D", "<p>執行前先由編譯器把原始碼翻成機器碼，產生執行檔</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>執行前先由編譯器把原始碼翻成機器碼，產生執行檔</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>C++ 的原始碼（.cpp）要先經過編譯、連結產生執行檔，才能執行。型別錯誤、語法錯誤大多在編譯時就會被抓出來。(A) 是直譯式語言的做法。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-2-2", "sid": "s1-2", "sec": "1.2 編譯式語言：和 R、Python 有什麼不同", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "強型別", "stem": "<p>C++ 是「強型別語言」，這是什麼意思？對寫程式有什麼好處與麻煩？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>每個變數、每個物件在使用前都必須宣告型別（例如 int、double），之後只能裝那種型別的資料。好處是很多錯誤（例如把文字當數字相加）在編譯時就會被發現，編譯器也能依型別產生更快的機器碼；麻煩是要多寫型別、不能像 R 一樣隨手把變數改裝別種資料，型別不合時要明確轉換。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-3-1", "sid": "s1-3", "sec": "1.3 第一支程式：Hello Quant World", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "程式從哪裡開始", "stem": "<p>一個 C++ 程式執行時，會從哪裡開始執行？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>檔案的第一行</p>"], ["B", "<p>第一個 #include 指令</p>"], ["C", "<p>main 函數</p>"], ["D", "<p>最後一個函數</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>main 函數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>main 是程式的入口點，不管它寫在檔案的哪裡，執行都從 main 的第一行開始。#include 是前處理指令，在編譯前就處理完了。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-3-2", "sid": "s1-3", "sec": "1.3 第一支程式：Hello Quant World", "kind": "填空", "level": "易", "title": "main 的回傳值", "stem": "<p><code>int main()</code> 結尾的 <code>return 0;</code> 表示程式執行 <strong><em>_</em>_；main 的回傳型態必須是 </strong>____。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>成功（正常結束）；int</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>回傳 0 給作業系統代表成功，非 0 通常代表錯誤；main 的回傳型態必須是 int。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-3-3", "sid": "s1-3", "sec": "1.3 第一支程式：Hello Quant World", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "易", "title": "印出三行", "stem": "<p>寫一支程式，印出三行文字：第一行「金融計算程式運用」，第二行「C++ 第一週」，第三行你的學號（隨便寫一個）。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"金融計算程式運用\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">endl</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"C++ 第一週\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">endl</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"112000000\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">endl</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>金融計算程式運用\nC++ 第一週\n112000000</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>每一行輸出都用 <code>std::endl</code>（或在字串結尾加 <code>\\n</code>）換行。中文可以直接放在雙引號字串裡，只要檔案存成 UTF-8。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-4-1", "sid": "s1-4", "sec": "1.4 語法的基本規矩與錯誤訊息", "kind": "找錯", "level": "易", "title": "找出語法錯誤", "stem": "<p>下面的程式有兩個錯誤，請找出來並改正。</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">Main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Hi\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">endl</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><ol>\n<li><code>Main</code> 要改成小寫 <code>main</code>（C++ 區分大小寫，沒有 main 程式無法連結成執行檔）。</li>\n<li><code>std::endl</code> 後面少了分號。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Hi\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">endl</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>Hi</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>漏分號是編譯錯誤；<code>Main</code> 的問題比較隱晦：如果只有這個錯，程式其實可以「編譯」，但在「連結」產生執行檔時會因為找不到 main 而失敗（1.6 節說明編譯與連結的差別）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-4-2", "sid": "s1-4", "sec": "1.4 語法的基本規矩與錯誤訊息", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "邏輯錯誤", "stem": "<p>下列哪一種錯誤<strong>不會</strong>被編譯器發現？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>return 0 那一行結尾少了分號</p>"], ["B", "<p>把 std::cout 打成 std::count</p>"], ["C", "<p>用了 cout 卻沒寫 #include <iostream></p>"], ["D", "<p>年利率 3% 寫成 3 而不是 0.03</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>年利率 3% 寫成 3 而不是 0.03</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>(A)(B)(C) 都違反語法或找不到名稱，編譯時就會報錯。(D) 是邏輯錯誤：程式合法、可以執行，只是算出來的結果錯了。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-5-1", "sid": "s1-5", "sec": "1.5 輸出到螢幕：std::cout", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "易", "title": "沒有換行", "stem": "<p>下面的程式會印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"B\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"C</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>ABC\n5</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>第一行沒有換行，所以 C 接在 AB 後面；<code>2 + 3</code> 會先算成 5 再輸出。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-5-2", "sid": "s1-5", "sec": "1.5 輸出到螢幕：std::cout", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "endl 與 \\n", "stem": "<p><code>std::endl</code> 和 <code>&quot;\\n&quot;</code> 的差別是什麼？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>endl 換行後還會清空（flush）緩衝區</p>"], ["B", "<p>endl 不會換行，只有 \\n 才會真正換到下一行</p>"], ["C", "<p>\\n 只能用在 printf，不能用在 cout</p>"], ["D", "<p>兩者完全沒有任何差別</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>endl 換行後還會清空（flush）緩衝區</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>兩者都會換行；endl 另外會 flush，把緩衝區內容立即寫出，所以大量輸出時稍慢。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-5-3", "sid": "s1-5", "sec": "1.5 輸出到螢幕：std::cout", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "報價表", "stem": "<p>用 <code>\\t</code> 和 <code>std::setprecision</code>，印出下面的報價表（價格固定 2 位小數）：</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">文字</span><pre><code>商品    價格\n債券A   101.25\n債券B   98.40</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"商品</span><span class=\"se\">\\t</span><span class=\"s\">價格</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"債券A</span><span class=\"se\">\\t</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">101.25</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"債券B</span><span class=\"se\">\\t</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">98.4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>商品\t價格\n債券A\t101.25\n債券B\t98.40</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>std::fixed &lt;&lt; std::setprecision(2)</code> 設定一次就一直有效，所以 98.4 會顯示成 98.40。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-6-1", "sid": "s1-6", "sec": "1.6 從原始碼到執行檔：建構的過程", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "前處理在做什麼", "stem": "<p><code>#include &lt;iostream&gt;</code> 在建構過程的哪個階段處理？做了什麼事？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>連結階段：把 iostream 編譯好的執行檔整個接進來</p>"], ["B", "<p>編譯階段：把 iostream 翻譯成組合語言後刪除</p>"], ["C", "<p>執行階段：程式跑到這一行時才去讀 iostream</p>"], ["D", "<p>前處理階段：把標頭檔的內容貼進原始碼</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>前處理階段：把標頭檔的內容貼進原始碼</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>#</code> 開頭的指令都由前處理器在編譯前處理；#include 就是把指定檔案的內容整份插入到這個位置。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-6-2", "sid": "s1-6", "sec": "1.6 從原始碼到執行檔：建構的過程", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "undefined reference", "stem": "<p>編譯時出現 <code>undefined reference to &#x27;present_value(double, double, int)&#x27;</code>，最可能的原因是什麼？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>少了一個分號</p>"], ["B", "<p>變數名稱有大寫字母</p>"], ["C", "<p>沒有 #include <iostream></p>"], ["D", "<p>函數有宣告，但連結時找不到它的定義</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>函數有宣告，但連結時找不到它的定義</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>undefined reference 是<strong>連結器</strong>的錯誤：宣告讓編譯通過了，但所有目標檔裡都找不到這個函數的實作。常見原因是忘了把定義所在的 .cpp 一起編譯，或宣告和定義的參數不一致。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-6-3", "sid": "s1-6", "sec": "1.6 從原始碼到執行檔：建構的過程", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "標頭檔與原始檔", "stem": "<p>為什麼 C++ 專案要把「宣告」放在 .h 標頭檔，把「定義」放在 .cpp 原始檔？include guard（#ifndef … #define … #endif）的作用是什麼？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>把宣告放在標頭檔，任何需要使用這些函數或類別的檔案只要 #include 標頭檔，就知道名字和呼叫方式；實作只寫在一個 .cpp 裡、只編譯一次，修改實作時不用重新編譯所有用到它的檔案，也避免同一個定義出現在多個地方。include guard 讓同一個標頭檔在同一個編譯單元中即使被 include 多次，內容也只會被處理一次，避免重複宣告或重複定義的錯誤。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-6-4", "sid": "s1-6", "sec": "1.6 從原始碼到執行檔：建構的過程", "kind": "填空", "level": "易", "title": "編譯參數", "stem": "<p>在終端機用 g++ 編譯 main.cpp，使用 C++20 標準、打開常見警告，並把執行檔命名為 app：<code>g++ ______ ______ main.cpp ______ app</code></p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p><code>-std=c++20</code>、<code>-Wall</code>、<code>-o</code></p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-7-1", "sid": "s1-7", "sec": "1.7 專案結構與 CMake", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "CMake 的角色", "stem": "<p>關於 CMake，下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>CMake 是一種 C++ 編譯器，取代 g++</p>"], ["B", "<p>使用 CMake 後就不需要編譯器了</p>"], ["C", "<p>CMake 只能在 Windows 的 Visual Studio 使用</p>"], ["D", "<p>CMake 依 CMakeLists.txt 產生各平台的建構檔</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>CMake 依 CMakeLists.txt 產生各平台的建構檔</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>CMake 本身不編譯程式；它讀 CMakeLists.txt，產生 Makefile、Visual Studio 專案或 build.ninja，再由 make／Ninja／MSBuild 呼叫真正的編譯器。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-7-2", "sid": "s1-7", "sec": "1.7 專案結構與 CMake", "kind": "填空", "level": "易", "title": "CMake 設定檔", "stem": "<p>CMake 的設定檔檔名是 <strong><em>_</em>_；在其中產生執行檔的指令是 </strong>____。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p><code>CMakeLists.txt</code>；<code>add_executable()</code></p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-8-1", "sid": "s1-8", "sec": "1.8 第一個金融小程式：複利與現值", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "次方", "stem": "<p>在 C++ 中，要計算 \\((1.05)^{10}\\)，正確的寫法是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>1.05 ^ 10</code>"], ["B", "<code>1.05 ** 10</code>"], ["C", "<code>std::pow(1.05, 10)</code>"], ["D", "<code>std::power(1.05, 10)</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>std::pow(1.05, 10)</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>C++ 沒有次方運算子；<code>^</code> 是位元互斥或（XOR），而且不能用在 double 上；<code>**</code> 不是 C++ 語法。要 <code>#include &lt;cmath&gt;</code> 後用 <code>std::pow(底數, 指數)</code>。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch01", "id": "q-s1-8-2", "sid": "s1-8", "sec": "1.8 第一個金融小程式：複利與現值", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "年金終值", "stem": "<p>每年年底存 10,000 元，年利率 2%，存 20 年。用 for 迴圈一年一年累加，印出第 20 年底的帳戶餘額（2 位小數），並和公式 \\(FV=C\\dfrac{(1+r)^n-1}{r}\\) 的結果比較。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">year</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">year</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">year</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\">// 先滾一年利息，再存入這一年的 10000</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">pow</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"迴圈：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">公式：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">formula</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>迴圈：242973.70\n公式：242973.70</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>每年的變化是「舊餘額 × (1+r) + 當年存入」；20 次之後和年金終值公式完全一致。用迴圈驗證公式（或用公式驗證迴圈）是寫金融程式的好習慣。</p></div>", "ch": "第 1 章　C++ 簡介與第一支程式"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-1-1", "sid": "s2-1", "sec": "2.1 型態：資料長什麼樣子", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "強型別", "stem": "<p>C++ 是「強型別語言」，指的是什麼？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>程式碼的關鍵字必須全部用大寫撰寫</p>"], ["B", "<p>變數要先宣告型態，之後不能改裝別種</p>"], ["C", "<p>只能使用整數運算，不能使用小數運算</p>"], ["D", "<p>型態在執行時才決定，編譯時不做檢查</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>變數要先宣告型態，之後不能改裝別種</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>強型別：變數在宣告時就決定型態，編譯器會依型態檢查每個操作是否合法。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-1-2", "sid": "s2-1", "sec": "2.1 型態：資料長什麼樣子", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "sizeof", "stem": "<p>在 64 位元 Linux 上，<code>sizeof(double)</code> 和 <code>sizeof(int)</code> 通常各是多少？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>8 和 4</p>"], ["B", "<p>4 和 4</p>"], ["C", "<p>8 和 8</p>"], ["D", "<p>16 和 2</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>8 和 4</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>double 佔 8 bytes、int 佔 4 bytes；這兩個在常見平台上都一樣。會因平台而不同的主要是 long。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-1-3", "sid": "s2-1", "sec": "2.1 型態：資料長什麼樣子", "kind": "填空", "level": "中", "title": "int 的範圍", "stem": "<p>4 bytes 的 <code>int</code> 最大值是 \\(2^{31}-1\\)，約等於 <strong><em>_</em>_（約幾億）；如果要存 3,000,000,000 這種數字，應改用 </strong>____ 型態。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>約 21 億（2,147,483,647）；<code>long long</code>（或 <code>unsigned int</code>、<code>double</code>）</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-2-1", "sid": "s2-2", "sec": "2.2 變數：有名字的一塊記憶體", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "初始化與賦值", "stem": "<p>關於初始化與賦值，下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>初始化可以發生很多次，賦值只能一次</p>"], ["B", "<p>初始化在變數定義時發生一次，賦值可以很多次</p>"], ["C", "<p>沒有初始化的區域變數，值一定是 0</p>"], ["D", "<p><code>int x;</code> 之後 <code>x = 5;</code> 這一行是初始化</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>初始化在變數定義時發生一次，賦值可以很多次</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>初始化是變數誕生時給的初值，只有一次；之後用 <code>=</code> 改值都是賦值。函數內未初始化的區域變數值是不確定的，不一定是 0。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-2-2", "sid": "s2-2", "sec": "2.2 變數：有名字的一塊記憶體", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "捨去小數", "stem": "<p>下面程式會印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">budget</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100000</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">337.5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lots</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">budget</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"c1\">// 可以買幾股</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lots</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>296</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>100000 / 337.5 = 296.296…，存進 int 時直接捨去小數，得到 296（不是四捨五入）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-2-3", "sid": "s2-2", "sec": "2.2 變數：有名字的一塊記憶體", "kind": "找錯", "level": "中", "title": "大括號初始化", "stem": "<p>為什麼 <code>int shares{1500.0 / 7};</code> 無法編譯，而 <code>int shares = 1500.0 / 7;</code> 可以？要怎麼寫才能兩者都明確表示「我就是要捨去小數」？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>大括號初始化不允許「縮窄轉換」（double → int 會遺失小數），所以編譯器拒絕；<code>=</code> 允許隱性轉換，只會給警告或什麼都不說。要明確表示捨去，用強制轉換：<code>int shares{static_cast&lt;int&gt;(1500.0 / 7)};</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"k\">static_cast</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1500.0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>214</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>static_cast&lt;目標型態&gt;(值)</code> 是 C++ 建議的轉換寫法（第 4 章詳細介紹），讓讀程式的人一看就知道這裡是刻意轉型。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-3-1", "sid": "s2-3", "sec": "2.3 整數與浮點數的陷阱", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "易", "title": "整數除法", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">held</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">90</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">held</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">360</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">held</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">360.0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">17</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0 0.25 2</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>90 / 360 兩個都是整數，結果捨去為 0；90 / 360.0 有浮點數，結果 0.25；17 除以 5 餘 2。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-3-2", "sid": "s2-3", "sec": "2.3 整數與浮點數的陷阱", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "unsigned 相減", "stem": "<p><code>unsigned a = 3, b = 5;</code> 則 <code>a - b</code> 的結果是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>-2</p>"], ["B", "<p>0</p>"], ["C", "<p>一個非常大的正整數</p>"], ["D", "<p>編譯錯誤，unsigned 不能相減</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>一個非常大的正整數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>unsigned 沒有負數，3 − 5 會繞回成 \\(2^{32}-2\\) = 4294967294。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-3-3", "sid": "s2-3", "sec": "2.3 整數與浮點數的陷阱", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "比較浮點數", "stem": "<p>要判斷 double 變數 <code>x</code> 是否「等於」0.3，下列何者最恰當？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>x == 0.3 &amp;&amp; x != 0</code>"], ["B", "<code>x = 0.3; x == 0.3</code>"], ["C", "<code>std::abs(x - 0.3) &lt; 1e-12</code>"], ["D", "<code>static_cast&lt;int&gt;(x) == 0.3</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>std::abs(x - 0.3) &lt; 1e-12</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>浮點數有表示誤差，用差距小於一個容忍值來判斷。(B) 是賦值不是比較；(D) 先把 x 截成整數，沒有意義。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-3-4", "sid": "s2-3", "sec": "2.3 整數與浮點數的陷阱", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "年化報酬", "stem": "<p>某股票買進價 120 元、賣出價 132 元，持有 73 天。寫程式計算持有期間報酬率與年化報酬率（單利，一年以 365 天計），兩者都用百分比、2 位小數印出。注意不要掉進整數除法的陷阱。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">120</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sell</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">132</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">days</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">73</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">sell</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buy</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">buy</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"c1\">// 持有期間報酬</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">annual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">365.0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">days</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"c1\">// 年化（單利）</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"持有期間報酬率：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"年化報酬率：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">annual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>持有期間報酬率：10.00%\n年化報酬率：50.00%</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>365.0 / days</code> 讓除法用浮點數計算；若寫成 <code>365 / days</code> 會得到整數 5（剛好整除時沒差，但換成 70 天就錯了）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-4-1", "sid": "s2-4", "sec": "2.4 常數與字面值", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "字元與字串", "stem": "<p>關於 <code>&#x27;a&#x27;</code> 與 <code>&quot;a&quot;</code>，下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>兩者完全相同，都是字元，都佔 1 byte</p>"], ["B", "<p>\"a\" 比 'a' 多一個結尾的 '\\0'，共 2 bytes</p>"], ["C", "<p>'a' 是字串，\"a\" 是字元，兩者都佔 1 byte</p>"], ["D", "<p>\"a\" 只佔 1 byte，'a' 因為是字元佔 2 bytes</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>\"a\" 比 'a' 多一個結尾的 '\\0'，共 2 bytes</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>單引號是字元，雙引號是字串；C 風格字串結尾會自動加上結束字元 '\\0'。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-4-2", "sid": "s2-4", "sec": "2.4 常數與字面值", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "八進位陷阱", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mo\">0050</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>40</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>0 開頭的整數字面值是八進位，八進位 50 = 5 × 8 = 40。股票代號這類「有前導 0 的代碼」應該用字串存。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-4-3", "sid": "s2-4", "sec": "2.4 常數與字面值", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "const 與 constexpr", "stem": "<p>下列何者<strong>一定</strong>要在編譯時就能算出值？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<code>const double r = read_rate();</code>"], ["B", "<code>constexpr int N = 252;</code>"], ["C", "<code>double r = 0.02;</code>"], ["D", "<code>int n;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><code>constexpr int N = 252;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>constexpr 要求在編譯期求值；const 只保證初始化後不能修改，初值可以在執行期才得到。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-4-4", "sid": "s2-4", "sec": "2.4 常數與字面值", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "易", "title": "手續費", "stem": "<p>用 <code>const</code> 定義手續費率 0.1425% 和證交稅率 0.3%，計算賣出 2,000 股、每股 85.6 元的手續費、證交稅與實收金額（賣出金額 − 手續費 − 稅），以整數元（捨去）印出。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FEE_RATE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.001425</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TAX_RATE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.003</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2000</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">85.6</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">amount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fee</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">static_cast</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">amount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FEE_RATE</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">static_cast</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">amount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TAX_RATE</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"成交金額：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">amount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">手續費：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fee</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">證交稅：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">實收：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">amount</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fee</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>成交金額：171200\n手續費：243\n證交稅：513\n實收：170444</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>費率宣告成 const 並取有意義的名字；<code>static_cast&lt;int&gt;</code> 明確表示捨去小數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-5-1", "sid": "s2-5", "sec": "2.5 從鍵盤輸入：std::cin", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "輸入運算子", "stem": "<p>要從鍵盤讀入一個整數到變數 <code>n</code>，正確的寫法是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>std::cout &gt;&gt; n;</code>"], ["B", "<code>std::cin &lt;&lt; n;</code>"], ["C", "<code>std::cin &gt;&gt; n;</code>"], ["D", "<code>std::cin(n);</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>std::cin &gt;&gt; n;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>cin 搭配 &gt;&gt;（資料流入變數）；cout 搭配 &lt;&lt;（資料流向螢幕）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-5-2", "sid": "s2-5", "sec": "2.5 從鍵盤輸入：std::cin", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "讀入計算", "stem": "<p>寫一支程式：從鍵盤讀入持股數與每股價格，印出持股市值。（用 <code>stdin</code> 輸入 <code>3000 45.2</code> 測試。）</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"持股數與價格：\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">市值 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out inp\" data-title=\"鍵盤輸入\"><code>3000 45.2</code></pre>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>持股數與價格：\n市值 = 135600</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-6-1", "sid": "s2-6", "sec": "2.6 變數與記憶體：位址", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "取址運算子", "stem": "<p><code>&amp;x</code>（x 是變數）的意思是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>x 的值加 1</p>"], ["B", "<p>x 在記憶體中的位址</p>"], ["C", "<p>x 佔用的位元組數</p>"], ["D", "<p>x 的參考型態（別名的型態）</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>x 在記憶體中的位址</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>在運算式中，&amp; 是取址運算子，得到變數的記憶體位址。佔用大小要用 sizeof。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-6-2", "sid": "s2-6", "sec": "2.6 變數與記憶體：位址", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "變數的三個資訊", "stem": "<p>用「置物櫃」的比喻說明：一個 <code>double</code> 變數的型態、位址、值分別代表什麼？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>記憶體像一排有編號的置物櫃，每格 1 byte。位址是這個變數第一格的編號（從哪裡開始）；型態 double 決定它佔連續 8 格，以及這 8 格的內容要怎麼解讀（解讀成有小數的數字）；值就是這 8 格裡實際存放的內容，例如 101.5。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-7-1", "sid": "s2-7", "sec": "2.7 參考：替變數取別名", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "參考改值", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>9 8</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>r 永遠是 x 的別名。<code>r = y</code> 是把 y 的值 8 放進 x；<code>r += 1</code> 讓 x 變 9；y 沒被改。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-7-2", "sid": "s2-7", "sec": "2.7 參考：替變數取別名", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "參考的規則", "stem": "<p>下列哪一行可以編譯？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<code>int v = 1; int &amp;r = v;</code>"], ["B", "<code>int &amp;r = 100;</code>"], ["C", "<code>int &amp;r;</code>"], ["D", "<code>int v = 1; double &amp;r = v;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><code>int v = 1; int &amp;r = v;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>參考必須初始化、只能綁定物件（不能是字面值）、型態必須相同。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-7-3", "sid": "s2-7", "sec": "2.7 參考：替變數取別名", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "用參考交換", "stem": "<p>寫一個函數 <code>void swap_price(double &amp;a, double &amp;b)</code>，交換兩個變數的值；在 main 裡交換買價 99.5 和賣價 100.5 並印出結果。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">swap_price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tmp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tmp</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">99.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ask</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">100.5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">swap_price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bid</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ask</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"bid = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"，ask = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ask</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>bid = 100.5，ask = 99.5</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>因為參數是參考，函數裡的 a、b 就是 main 的 bid、ask 本身，交換會反映回呼叫端。如果參數寫成 <code>double a, double b</code>（傳值），交換的只是副本，main 裡的值不會變。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-8-1", "sid": "s2-8", "sec": "2.8 指標：存放位址的變數", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "指標改值", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>10 8</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>*p = 10</code> 改的是 a；接著 p 改指向 b，<code>*p = *p + 1</code> 讓 b 變 8。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-8-2", "sid": "s2-8", "sec": "2.8 指標：存放位址的變數", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "指標與參考", "stem": "<p>關於指標與參考，下列何者<strong>錯誤</strong>？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>指標可以是 nullptr，參考不能為空</p>"], ["B", "<p>指標可以改指向別的物件，參考綁定後不能改綁</p>"], ["C", "<p>指標本身有自己的位址，所以可以有指標的指標</p>"], ["D", "<p>參考是物件，有自己獨立的記憶體位址</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>參考是物件，有自己獨立的記憶體位址</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>參考不是物件，只是別名；對參考取址得到的是它綁定的那個物件的位址。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-8-3", "sid": "s2-8", "sec": "2.8 指標：存放位址的變數", "kind": "填空", "level": "中", "title": "兩個符號", "stem": "<p>在 <code>int *p = &amp;x;</code> 這一行中，<code>*</code> 的作用是 <strong><em>_</em>_，<code>&amp;</code> 的作用是 </strong><strong><em>_；在 <code>y = *p;</code> 中，<code>*</code> 的作用是 </em></strong>___。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>宣告 p 是指標；取 x 的位址；解參考（取得 p 指向的值）</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>同一個符號在宣告中和在運算式中意義不同，要看上下文。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-8-4", "sid": "s2-8", "sec": "2.8 指標：存放位址的變數", "kind": "找錯", "level": "中", "title": "未初始化的指標", "stem": "<p>下面的程式哪裡危險？要怎麼改？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>p 沒有初始化，是一個無效指標，指向不知道哪裡的記憶體；<code>*p = 1.5</code> 會寫進未知位置，可能讓程式崩潰（未定義行為），而編譯器不一定會報錯。應先讓它指向一個真的物件，或初始化成 nullptr 並在使用前檢查：</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>1.5</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-9-1", "sid": "s2-9", "sec": "2.9 const 與指標、右值參考", "kind": "選擇", "level": "難", "title": "const 的位置", "stem": "<p><code>double x = 1, y = 2; double *const p = &amp;x;</code> 之後，下列哪一行<strong>無法</strong>編譯？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>*p = 3;</code>"], ["B", "<code>x = 4;</code>"], ["C", "<code>p = &amp;y;</code>"], ["D", "<code>double z = *p;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>p = &amp;y;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>double *const p</code> 是常數指標（Top-Level const）：p 本身不能改指向，但可以透過 p 修改 x。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-9-2", "sid": "s2-9", "sec": "2.9 const 與指標、右值參考", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "const 參考的用途", "stem": "<p>為什麼函數參數常寫成 <code>const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;returns</code>，而不是 <code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; returns</code> 或 <code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;returns</code>？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>寫成 <code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; returns</code>（傳值）會把整份資料複製一次，資料大時很慢；寫成 <code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;returns</code>（一般參考）不複製，但函數可能不小心修改呼叫端的資料。<code>const</code> 參考兩者兼顧：不複製、又保證函數只能讀不能改，也能接受臨時物件。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-10-1", "sid": "s2-10", "sec": "2.10 自訂型態：struct、enum、union", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "存取成員", "stem": "<p><code>Bond b; Bond *pb = &amp;b;</code> 要取得 b 的 face 成員，下列何者<strong>錯誤</strong>？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<code>b.face</code>"], ["B", "<code>pb-&gt;face</code>"], ["C", "<code>(*pb).face</code>"], ["D", "<code>pb.face</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><code>pb.face</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>物件用 <code>.</code>，指標用 <code>-&gt;</code>（等於先解參考再用 <code>.</code>）。pb 是指標，不能直接用 <code>.</code>。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-10-2", "sid": "s2-10", "sec": "2.10 自訂型態：struct、enum、union", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "enum 的值", "stem": "<p><code>enum Color { Red = 7, Green, Blue = 2, Yellow };</code> 中 Green 和 Yellow 的值分別是？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>8 和 3</p>"], ["B", "<p>1 和 3</p>"], ["C", "<p>8 和 4</p>"], ["D", "<p>7 和 2</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>8 和 3</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>沒有指定值的列舉常數，等於前一個加 1：Green = 7 + 1 = 8，Yellow = 2 + 1 = 3。（這是老師講義的例子。）</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch02", "id": "q-s2-10-3", "sid": "s2-10", "sec": "2.10 自訂型態：struct、enum、union", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "股票部位", "stem": "<p>定義 <code>struct Position { std::string ticker; int shares; double cost; double price; };</code>，建立兩個部位，寫程式計算並印出每個部位的未實現損益（(price − cost) × shares）與合計。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;string&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cost</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s\">\"2330\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">980.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1015.0</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s\">\"2317\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">185.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">178.5</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pnl1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cost</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pnl2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cost</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pnl1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pnl2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"合計：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pnl1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pnl2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>2330：35000\n2317：-13000\n合計：22000</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>學完第 3 章的 vector 後，可以把很多個 Position 放進 <code>std::vector&lt;Position&gt;</code>，用迴圈一次算完；第 7 章再把「計算損益」做成 Position 自己的成員函數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 2 章　資料型態、變數與記憶體"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-1-1", "sid": "s3-1", "sec": "3.1 一維陣列", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "下標", "stem": "<p><code>double r[12];</code> 這個陣列合法可使用的元素是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p><code>r[1]</code> 到 <code>r[12]</code></p>"], ["B", "<p><code>r[0]</code> 到 <code>r[11]</code></p>"], ["C", "<p><code>r[0]</code> 到 <code>r[12]</code></p>"], ["D", "<p><code>r[1]</code> 到 <code>r[11]</code></p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p><code>r[0]</code> 到 <code>r[11]</code></p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>下標從 0 開始，12 個元素的最後一個是 r[11]。使用 r[12] 是越界，編譯器不會阻止。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-1-2", "sid": "s3-1", "sec": "3.1 一維陣列", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "易", "title": "部分初始化", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>5 0 6</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>w[1] = 1、w[2] = 4；未給初值的元素自動為 0；陣列長度是宣告的 6。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-1-3", "sid": "s3-1", "sec": "3.1 一維陣列", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "日報酬率", "stem": "<p>給定 6 天收盤價 <code>{50.0, 51.0, 50.5, 52.0, 53.5, 53.0}</code>，用陣列與 for 迴圈算出 5 個日報酬率（\\(r_t = P_t / P_{t-1} - 1\\)），存進另一個陣列，再印出每天報酬率（百分比）與平均日報酬率。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">50.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">51.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">50.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">52.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">53.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">53.0</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"第 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" 天：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"平均：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>第 1 天：2.000%\n第 2 天：-0.980%\n第 3 天：2.970%\n第 4 天：2.885%\n第 5 天：-0.935%\n平均：1.188%</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>6 個價格只能算出 5 個報酬率；迴圈從 t = 1 開始，才能取用 p[t − 1]。如果從 t = 0 開始，就會讀到 p[−1]，越界。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-2-1", "sid": "s3-2", "sec": "3.2 二維陣列", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "按列存放", "stem": "<p><code>int a[2][3];</code> 在記憶體中，緊接在 <code>a[0][2]</code> 後面的元素是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>a[1][2]</code>"], ["B", "<code>a[0][3]</code>"], ["C", "<code>a[1][0]</code>"], ["D", "<code>a[2][0]</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>a[1][0]</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>C++ 按列存放：第 0 列的 3 個元素放完後，接著是第 1 列的第一個元素 a[1][0]。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-2-2", "sid": "s3-2", "sec": "3.2 二維陣列", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "部分初始化二維", "stem": "<p><code>int a[][3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5}, {7}};</code> 之後，<code>sizeof(a) / sizeof(a[0])</code> 和 <code>a[1][2] + a[2][0]</code> 分別是？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>3 和 7</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>有三組大括號，所以有 3 列；a[1][2] 沒給值，補 0；a[2][0] = 7。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-3-1", "sid": "s3-3", "sec": "3.3 指標與陣列", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "指標算術", "stem": "<p><code>double a[4] = {1.5, 2.5, 3.5, 4.5}; double *p = a + 1;</code> 則 <code>*(p + 2)</code> 的值是？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>3.5</p>"], ["B", "<p>越界，無法確定</p>"], ["C", "<p>2.5</p>"], ["D", "<p>4.5</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>4.5</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>p 指向 a[1]，p + 2 指向 a[3]，值為 4.5。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-3-2", "sid": "s3-3", "sec": "3.3 指標與陣列", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "陣列名稱", "stem": "<p><code>int a[3] = {1, 2, 3}; int *p = a;</code> 之後，下列哪一行<strong>無法</strong>編譯？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<code>a++;</code>"], ["B", "<code>p++;</code>"], ["C", "<code>*(a + 1) = 5;</code>"], ["D", "<code>p = a + 2;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><code>a++;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>陣列名稱代表的首位址不能被修改；指標變數 p 可以移動。<code>*(a + 1) = 5</code> 是修改元素，合法。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-3-3", "sid": "s3-3", "sec": "3.3 指標與陣列", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "型態決定步伐", "stem": "<p><code>int *p</code> 與 <code>int (*q)[10]</code> 都可以指向 <code>int a[10]</code> 的開頭（位址相同），為什麼 <code>p + 1</code> 與 <code>q + 1</code> 的位址不同？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>指標加 1 是「往後移動一個它所指的型態」。p 指向 int，加 1 移動 4 bytes（下一個元素）；q 指向「10 個 int 的陣列」，加 1 移動 40 bytes（跳過整個陣列）。位址相同，但型態不同，步伐就不同。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-4-1", "sid": "s3-4", "sec": "3.4 字元陣列與 C 風格字串", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "字串長度", "stem": "<p><code>char s[] = &quot;2330&quot;;</code> 則 <code>sizeof(s)</code> 與 <code>strlen(s)</code> 分別是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>4 和 4</p>"], ["B", "<p>5 和 5</p>"], ["C", "<p>5 和 4</p>"], ["D", "<p>4 和 5</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>5 和 4</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>字串字面值會自動加上 '\\0'，陣列有 5 個 char；strlen 計算到 '\\0' 之前，為 4。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-4-2", "sid": "s3-4", "sec": "3.4 字元陣列與 C 風格字串", "kind": "找錯", "level": "中", "title": "字元陣列賦值", "stem": "<p>下面程式為什麼無法編譯？請用兩種方式修正。</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"2330.TW\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>陣列名稱不能被賦值。修正方式一：用 <code>std::strcpy(ticker, &quot;2330.TW&quot;);</code>（要 <code>#include &lt;cstring&gt;</code>）；方式二（建議）：改用 <code>std::string ticker; ticker = &quot;2330.TW&quot;;</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"2330.TW\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>2330.TW</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-4-3", "sid": "s3-4", "sec": "3.4 字元陣列與 C 風格字串", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "字元指標", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Futures\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>t ures</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>*(p + 2)</code> 是第 3 個字元 t；<code>p + 3</code> 仍是 char*，cout 從第 4 個字元開始印到結尾，得到 ures。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-5-1", "sid": "s3-5", "sec": "3.5 std::vector：會長大的陣列", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "() 與 {}", "stem": "<p><code>std::vector&lt;int&gt; v(10);</code> 和 <code>std::vector&lt;int&gt; u{10};</code> 分別有幾個元素？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>1 個和 10 個</p>"], ["B", "<p>10 個和 10 個</p>"], ["C", "<p>10 個和 1 個</p>"], ["D", "<p>1 個和 1 個</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>10 個和 1 個</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>小括號表示「個數」：10 個 0；大括號表示「內容」：一個值為 10 的元素。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-5-2", "sid": "s3-5", "sec": "3.5 std::vector：會長大的陣列", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "vector 操作", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">push_back</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">push_back</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">pop_back</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">front</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">back</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>4 5 1</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>初始 {7, 7, 7}，加入 1、2 後 {7, 7, 7, 1, 2}，pop_back 移除 2，再把第一個改成 5：{5, 7, 7, 1}。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-5-3", "sid": "s3-5", "sec": "3.5 std::vector：會長大的陣列", "kind": "找錯", "level": "中", "title": "range for 修改", "stem": "<p>下面程式想把每個價格調漲 10%，為什麼印出來沒變？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p><code>double x</code> 是每個元素的副本，修改副本不會影響 vector。要改成 <code>for (double &amp;x : p) x *= 1.1;</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>110 220</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-5-4", "sid": "s3-5", "sec": "3.5 std::vector：會長大的陣列", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "樣本標準差", "stem": "<p>用 vector 存放報酬率 <code>{0.012, -0.008, 0.021, 0.004, -0.015, 0.009}</code>，計算平均數與樣本標準差（分母 n − 1），再年化波動度（日標準差 × √252）。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">0.012</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-0.008</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.021</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.004</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-0.015</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.009</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">sqrt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"平均 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">標準差 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sd</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">年化波動度 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sd</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">sqrt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">252.0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>平均 = 0.00383333\n標準差 = 0.0132878\n年化波動度 = 0.210938</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>用 vector 的好處是 <code>r.size()</code> 可以直接得到個數，換成 1000 筆資料程式完全不用改。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-6-1", "sid": "s3-6", "sec": "3.6 std::string：好用的字串", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "字串相接", "stem": "<p>下列哪一行<strong>無法</strong>編譯？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>std::string a = std::string(&quot;BTC&quot;) + &quot;-USD&quot;;</code>"], ["B", "<code>std::string b = &quot;BTC&quot;; b += &quot;-USD&quot;;</code>"], ["C", "<code>std::string c = &quot;BTC&quot; + &quot;-USD&quot;;</code>"], ["D", "<code>std::string d = &quot;BTC&quot;; std::string e = d + &quot;-&quot; + &quot;USD&quot;;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>std::string c = &quot;BTC&quot; + &quot;-USD&quot;;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>兩個字串字面值是 const char*，不能相加；只要 + 的其中一邊是 std::string 就可以。D 由左往右算，d + \"-\" 先得到 string，再加 \"USD\"。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-6-2", "sid": "s3-6", "sec": "3.6 std::string：好用的字串", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": ">> 與 getline", "stem": "<p>輸入一列 <code>Cathay Financial Holding</code> 並按 Enter，<code>std::cin &gt;&gt; s;</code> 讀到的 s 是？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<code>Cathay</code>"], ["B", "<code>Cathay Financial Holding</code>"], ["C", "<p>空字串</p>"], ["D", "<code>Holding</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><code>Cathay</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>讀到空白就停止；要讀整列用 std::getline(std::cin, s)。</p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-6-3", "sid": "s3-6", "sec": "3.6 std::string：好用的字串", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "解析交易紀錄", "stem": "<p>字串 <code>&quot;2330,1000,1015.5&quot;</code> 分別是代號、股數、價格。用 <code>find</code>、<code>substr</code>、<code>stoi</code>、<code>stod</code> 拆開，印出「2330 成交金額 1015500」。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;string&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rec</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"2330,1000,1015.5\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"kt\">size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rec</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">find</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">','</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"kt\">size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rec</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">find</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">','</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">           </span><span class=\"c1\">// 從 p1 之後找第二個逗號</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rec</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">substr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stoi</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rec</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">substr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stod</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rec</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">substr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\">// 不要用科學記號</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ticker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" 成交金額 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">shares</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>2330 成交金額 1015500</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>find(字元, 起點)</code> 可以從指定位置開始找；<code>substr(起點, 長度)</code> 的第二個參數是長度，不是終點。1015500 有 7 位數，cout 預設只顯示 6 位有效數字，會變成科學記號 1.0155e+06，所以用 <code>std::fixed</code> 搭配 <code>setprecision(0)</code>。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-7-1", "sid": "s3-7", "sec": "3.7 迭代器：統一的「走訪」方式", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "end()", "stem": "<p>關於 <code>v.end()</code>，下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>指向 vector 的最後一個元素</p>"], ["B", "<p>指向最後一個元素的下一個位置，不能解參考</p>"], ["C", "<p>回傳 vector 的元素個數</p>"], ["D", "<p>指向 vector 的第一個元素前面的位置</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>指向最後一個元素的下一個位置，不能解參考</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>end() 是「尾後」位置，只當作結束標記；最後一個元素要用 <code>end() - 1</code>、<code>back()</code> 或 <code>rbegin()</code>。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-7-2", "sid": "s3-7", "sec": "3.7 迭代器：統一的「走訪」方式", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "const_iterator", "stem": "<p><code>for (auto it = v.cbegin(); it != v.cend(); ++it)</code> 這個迴圈中，下列何者<strong>不允許</strong>？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<code>*it = 0;</code>"], ["B", "<code>std::cout &lt;&lt; *it;</code>"], ["C", "<code>++it</code>"], ["D", "<code>it != v.cend()</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><code>*it = 0;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>const_iterator 指向的元素是唯讀的；迭代器本身可以移動與比較。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-7-3", "sid": "s3-7", "sec": "3.7 迭代器：統一的「走訪」方式", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "迭代器失效", "stem": "<p>為什麼「一邊用迭代器走 vector、一邊 <code>push_back</code>」很危險？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>vector 的元素存放在一塊連續記憶體，push_back 時若容量不足，會配置一塊更大的記憶體並把所有元素搬過去，舊的記憶體被釋放。原本的迭代器（以及指標、參考）仍指向舊位置，變成失效的迭代器，再使用會造成未定義行為。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch03", "id": "q-s3-7-4", "sid": "s3-7", "sec": "3.7 迭代器：統一的「走訪」方式", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "排序與中位數", "stem": "<p>給定一組基金年報酬 <code>{5.2, -3.1, 12.4, 8.0, 0.7, 15.3, -6.2}</code>（%），用 <code>std::sort</code> 排序後印出由小到大的結果與中位數，再用 <code>std::count_if</code> 算出報酬超過 5% 的基金數。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">5.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-3.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">12.4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">8.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">15.3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-6.2</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">sort</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">begin</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">end</span><span class=\"p\">());</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">中位數 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">count_if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">begin</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">end</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[](</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">});</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"超過 5% 的有 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" 檔</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>-6.2 -3.1 0.7 5.2 8 12.4 15.3 \n中位數 = 5.2\n超過 5% 的有 4 檔</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>7 個元素時中位數在下標 3；若個數是偶數，中位數要取中間兩個的平均。</p></div>", "ch": "第 3 章　陣列、指標與字串"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-1-1", "sid": "s4-1", "sec": "4.1 表達式、運算子與優先順序", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "易", "title": "優先順序", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>4 9 4</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>4 / 2 * 3 由左往右 = 6，10 − 6 = 4；(10 − 4) / 2 * 3 = 9；20 % 6 = 2，再乘 2 = 4。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-1-2", "sid": "s4-1", "sec": "4.1 表達式、運算子與優先順序", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "左值", "stem": "<p><code>int a = 1, *p = &amp;a; std::vector&lt;int&gt; v{1, 2};</code> 下列何者<strong>不能</strong>放在 <code>=</code> 的左邊？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>*p</code>"], ["B", "<p><code>v[0]</code>（下標的結果）</p>"], ["C", "<code>a + 1</code>"], ["D", "<code>a</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>a + 1</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>a + 1</code> 的結果是臨時的右值；解參考 <code>*p</code> 與下標 <code>v[0]</code> 的結果都是左值。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-2-1", "sid": "s4-2", "sec": "4.2 算術運算與型態轉換", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "隱式轉換", "stem": "<p><code>char a = &#x27;A&#x27;; short b = 2;</code> 則 <code>a + b</code> 的結果型態是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>char</p>"], ["B", "<p>short</p>"], ["C", "<p>int</p>"], ["D", "<p>double</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>int</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>char、short 參與算術前會先提升為 int，所以結果是 int（值為 67）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-2-2", "sid": "s4-2", "sec": "4.2 算術運算與型態轉換", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "整數除法與轉型", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">up</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">13</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">total</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">up</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">total</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">static_cast</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">up</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">total</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">static_cast</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">up</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">total</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0 0.65 0</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>r1：整數相除得 0 再轉成 double；r2：先轉型再除，得 0.65；r3：括號內先做整數除法得 0，再轉型也救不回來。轉型的位置很重要。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-2-3", "sid": "s4-2", "sec": "4.2 算術運算與型態轉換", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "轉型方式", "stem": "<p>現代 C++ 中，把 double 轉成 int 最建議的寫法是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>(int)x</code>"], ["B", "<code>reinterpret_cast&lt;int&gt;(x)</code>"], ["C", "<code>static_cast&lt;int&gt;(x)</code>"], ["D", "<code>const_cast&lt;int&gt;(x)</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>static_cast&lt;int&gt;(x)</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>一般數值轉型用 static_cast；C 風格轉型不做檢查也不易搜尋；reinterpret_cast 與 const_cast 用途特殊且危險。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-3-1", "sid": "s4-3", "sec": "4.3 比較與邏輯運算", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "短路求值", "stem": "<p><code>int n = 0;</code> 執行 <code>bool ok = (n &gt; 0) &amp;&amp; (100 / n &gt; 5);</code> 會發生什麼？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>先算 100 / n，除以 0 讓程式崩潰</p>"], ["B", "<p>編譯錯誤，因為不能在 if 的條件裡面做除法</p>"], ["C", "<p>ok 為 true，因為右邊條件成立</p>"], ["D", "<p>ok 為 false，且右邊不會被計算</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>ok 為 false，且右邊不會被計算</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>&amp;&amp; 左邊 n &gt; 0 為 false，結果已確定為 false，右邊不會被計算，所以不會除以 0。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-3-2", "sid": "s4-3", "sec": "4.3 比較與邏輯運算", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "連續比較", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">9</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0 0</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>a &gt; b &gt; c 解讀為 (a &gt; b) &gt; c，即 1 &gt; 7，為 false（印 0）；a &gt; b &amp;&amp; b &gt; c 中 b &gt; c 為 false，結果也是 0。換成 c = 0 時兩者就會不同。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-3-3", "sid": "s4-3", "sec": "4.3 比較與邏輯運算", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "選股條件", "stem": "<p>一檔股票滿足「本益比介於 8 到 20（含）之間，而且（殖利率 ≥ 4% 或 ROE ≥ 15%）」就列入觀察。寫程式判斷本益比 12、殖利率 3.5%、ROE 17% 的股票是否列入，印出 true/false。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.035</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">roe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.17</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">watch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.04</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">roe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.15</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">boolalpha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">watch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>true</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>「介於」要拆成兩個比較用 &amp;&amp; 連接；「或」的部分要加括號，因為 &amp;&amp; 的優先順序比 || 高。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-4-1", "sid": "s4-4", "sec": "4.4 賦值、遞增與其他運算子", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "前置與後置", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>7 10 14</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>a++ 交出原值 5，b = 10，之後 a = 6；++a 先加成 7 再交出 7，c = 14。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-4-2", "sid": "s4-4", "sec": "4.4 賦值、遞增與其他運算子", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "複合賦值", "stem": "<p><code>double x = 100; x *= 1 + 0.05;</code> 之後 x 是多少？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>100.05</p>"], ["B", "<p>101</p>"], ["C", "<p>5</p>"], ["D", "<p>105</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>105</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>x *= 1 + 0.05</code> 等於 <code>x = x * (1 + 0.05)</code>，右邊整個先算完，得 105。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-4-3", "sid": "s4-4", "sec": "4.4 賦值、遞增與其他運算子", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "易", "title": "條件運算子", "stem": "<p>用條件運算子寫一行：若 <code>ret</code> 大於等於 0 印出 \"▲\" 加上報酬率，否則印出 \"▼\" 加上報酬率的絕對值。分別測試 0.023 與 -0.015。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rets</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">0.023</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-0.015</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ret</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rets</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ret</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"▲ \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"▼ \"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ret</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>▲ 2.3%\n▼ 1.5%</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-5-1", "sid": "s4-5", "sec": "4.5 語句與作用域", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "空語句", "stem": "<p>下面程式片段會怎樣？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>n 變成 1</p>"], ["B", "<p>n 變成 5</p>"], ["C", "<p>無窮迴圈</p>"], ["D", "<p>編譯錯誤</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>n 變成 1</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>for 後面的分號讓迴圈本體變成空語句：迴圈空跑 5 次，之後 <code>++n;</code> 只執行一次。縮排不會改變程式的意義。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-5-2", "sid": "s4-5", "sec": "4.5 語句與作用域", "kind": "簡答", "level": "易", "title": "作用域", "stem": "<p>為什麼在 <code>for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) {...}</code> 之後無法使用 <code>i</code>？如果迴圈結束後需要知道 i 停在哪裡，應該怎麼寫？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>i 宣告在 for 的括號裡，作用域只限於這個 for 語句，迴圈結束時就被銷毀。若之後需要用，就把 i 宣告在迴圈外：<code>int i; for (i = 0; i &lt; n; ++i) {...}</code>，迴圈結束後 i 仍然存在。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-6-1", "sid": "s4-6", "sec": "4.6 條件語句：if 與 switch", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "else if 順序", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.25</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"高\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"很高\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"低\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>高</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>第一個條件 r &gt; 0.1 就成立了，後面的 else if 不會再檢查。要判斷「很高」應該把較嚴格的條件放前面。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-6-2", "sid": "s4-6", "sec": "4.6 條件語句：if 與 switch", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "switch 的條件", "stem": "<p>下列哪一個<strong>不能</strong>當作 switch 的表達式？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p><code>unsigned long</code> 變數</p>"], ["B", "<p><code>char</code> 型態的變數</p>"], ["C", "<p><code>enum class</code> 變數</p>"], ["D", "<p><code>std::string</code> 變數</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p><code>std::string</code> 變數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>switch 只能用整數類型（含 char、bool、enum）；字串要用 if / else if 比較。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-6-3", "sid": "s4-6", "sec": "4.6 條件語句：if 與 switch", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "所得稅級距", "stem": "<p>用 if / else if 寫程式，依所得 <code>income</code> 計算適用稅率：56 萬以下 5%、56～126 萬 12%、126～252 萬 20%、252～472 萬 30%、以上 40%（簡化：整筆所得適用同一稅率）。測試 1,500,000 元，印出稅率與稅額。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">income</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1500000</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">income</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">560000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.05</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">income</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1260000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.12</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">income</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2520000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.20</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">income</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4720000</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.30</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.40</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"稅率 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%，稅額 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">income</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>稅率 20%，稅額 300000</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>由低到高排列時，每個 else if 只需寫上限，因為能走到那裡代表前面的條件都不成立。（實際稅制是累進差額，第 5 章可以做成函數改寫。）</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-7-1", "sid": "s4-7", "sec": "4.7 迴圈：while、do-while、for", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "do-while", "stem": "<p>關於 <code>do { ... } while (cond);</code>，下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>cond 一開始為 false 時，本體一次都不執行</p>"], ["B", "<p>本體至少會執行一次</p>"], ["C", "<p>while 後面不需要分號</p>"], ["D", "<p>和 for 迴圈完全相同</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>本體至少會執行一次</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>do-while 先執行再判斷，所以至少執行一次；結尾的 <code>while (cond);</code> 必須有分號。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-7-2", "sid": "s4-7", "sec": "4.7 迴圈：while、do-while、for", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "for 執行順序", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">count</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">count</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"| \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">count</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>10 7 4 1 | 4</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>i 依序為 10、7、4、1；下一次 i = −2 時條件不成立，迴圈結束，共 4 次。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-7-3", "sid": "s4-7", "sec": "4.7 迴圈：while、do-while、for", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "房貸攤還", "stem": "<p>房貸 800 萬、年利率 2.1%（月利率 = 年利率 / 12）、20 年按月本息平均攤還。每月付款 \\(PMT = P \\cdot \\dfrac{r}{1-(1+r)^{-n}}\\)。用 for 迴圈模擬攤還，印出每月付款、第 1 期的利息與本金，以及每 5 年底的剩餘本金。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8000000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.021</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">240</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pmt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">pow</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"每月付款：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pmt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pmt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interest</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"第 1 期 利息 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">interest</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"，本金 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"第 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" 年底剩餘本金：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">abs</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">balance</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>每月付款：40851\n第 1 期 利息 14000，本金 26851\n第 5 年底剩餘本金：6302907\n第 10 年底剩餘本金：4418100\n第 15 年底剩餘本金：2324818\n第 20 年底剩餘本金：0</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>每期利息 = 剩餘本金 × 月利率，本金 = 付款 − 利息。最後剩餘本金應為 0（浮點誤差可能出現 −0，所以用 abs）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-8-1", "sid": "s4-8", "sec": "4.8 跳躍：break、continue（與不推薦的 goto）", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "break 與 continue", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">continue</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">break</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>1 2 4 5 7</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>3、6 被 continue 跳過；i = 8 時 8 &gt; 7，break 結束迴圈（9 是 3 的倍數，但已經跑不到了）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-8-2", "sid": "s4-8", "sec": "4.8 跳躍：break、continue（與不推薦的 goto）", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "巢狀 break", "stem": "<p>在兩層 for 迴圈的<strong>內層</strong>執行 <code>break</code>，會發生什麼？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>內外兩層迴圈都會一起結束</p>"], ["B", "<p>只結束內層，外層繼續下一次</p>"], ["C", "<p>結束整個程式，回傳 0</p>"], ["D", "<p>只跳過內層迴圈的這一次迭代</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>只結束內層，外層繼續下一次</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>break 只跳出最近的一層迴圈；要一次跳出多層，通常用旗標變數或把迴圈包成函數後 return。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-9-1", "sid": "s4-9", "sec": "4.9 綜合應用：用迴圈解方程式", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "為什麼用 while", "stem": "<p>為什麼求殖利率的二分法適合用 while 而不是固定次數的 for？要讓程式更安全，應該再加上什麼條件？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>因為事前不知道要猜幾次才能達到精度，停止條件是「誤差小於容忍值」，所以用 while 表達最自然。為了避免意外狀況（例如區間設錯永遠不收斂）造成無窮迴圈，應該同時加上最大迭代次數的上限，例如 <code>while (hi - lo &gt; 1e-10 &amp;&amp; iter &lt; 200)</code>。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-9-2", "sid": "s4-9", "sec": "4.9 綜合應用：用迴圈解方程式", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "難", "title": "二分法求隱含報酬", "stem": "<p>一張零息債券 3 年後償還 100 元，現在價格 91 元。用二分法（區間 0～0.5）求年化殖利率 \\(y\\)，使 \\(100/(1+y)^3 = 91\\)，並與公式解 \\(y = (100/91)^{1/3} - 1\\) 比較。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1e-12</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">iter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">200</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">mid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">pow</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mid</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">91</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mid</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mid</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">iter</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"二分法：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"公式解：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">pow</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">100.0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">91</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>二分法：0.0319362513\n公式解：0.0319362513</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>零息債有公式解，可以拿來驗證數值方法寫得對不對——這是寫數值程式的好習慣：先在有答案的問題上測試。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-10-1", "sid": "s4-10", "sec": "4.10 例外處理：throw、try、catch", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "throw 之後", "stem": "<p>在 try 區塊中執行到 <code>throw std::runtime_error(&quot;x&quot;);</code> 之後，會發生什麼？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>印出訊息後繼續執行 try 區塊的下一行</p>"], ["B", "<p>跳到相符的 catch，try 剩下的不執行</p>"], ["C", "<p>不論有沒有對應的 catch，程式一定立刻終止</p>"], ["D", "<p>回到 try 區塊的第一行，重新執行一次</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>跳到相符的 catch，try 剩下的不執行</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>throw 會中斷目前的流程，尋找型態相符的 catch；找不到才會終止程式。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch04", "id": "q-s4-10-2", "sid": "s4-10", "sec": "4.10 例外處理：throw、try、catch", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "輸入檢查", "stem": "<p>寫程式計算 Sharpe ratio \\(=(R_p - R_f)/\\sigma_p\\)：當 \\(\\sigma_p \\le 0\\) 時丟出 <code>std::invalid_argument</code>，在 main 中用 try/catch 處理。分別測試 σ = 0.15 與 σ = 0。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;stdexcept&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sigmas</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">0.15</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.0</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sigmas</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">try</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">throw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">invalid_argument</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"波動度必須大於 0\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Sharpe = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rf</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">catch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">invalid_argument</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"錯誤：\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">what</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>Sharpe = 0.533333\n錯誤：波動度必須大於 0</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>浮點數除以 0 在 C++ 不會讓程式崩潰，而是得到 inf，錯誤的數字會一路傳下去；主動檢查並丟出例外，問題才不會被藏起來。</p></div>", "ch": "第 4 章　表達式、運算子與流程控制"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-1-1", "sid": "s5-1", "sec": "5.1 函數基礎", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "函數組成", "stem": "<p><code>double npv(double rate, const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;cf)</code> 中，<code>double</code>（最前面）代表什麼？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>第一個參數的型態</p>"], ["B", "<p>函數體內所有變數的型態</p>"], ["C", "<p>函數名稱的一部分</p>"], ["D", "<p>函數回傳值的型態</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>函數回傳值的型態</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>寫在函數名稱前面的是回傳型態；括號裡的是形式參數列表。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-1-2", "sid": "s5-1", "sec": "5.1 函數基礎", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "宣告與定義", "stem": "<p>關於函數宣告（原型），下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>宣告必須包含完整的函數體</p>"], ["B", "<p>同一個函數有了定義，就不能再寫宣告</p>"], ["C", "<p>宣告與定義一定要寫在同一個 .cpp 檔案</p>"], ["D", "<p>宣告以分號結尾，描述名稱、形參與回傳型態</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>宣告以分號結尾，描述名稱、形參與回傳型態</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>宣告只描述介面，以分號結尾，通常放在標頭檔；定義才有函數體，可以放在另一個 .cpp。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-1-3", "sid": "s5-1", "sec": "5.1 函數基礎", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "易", "title": "第一個函數", "stem": "<p>寫一個函數 <code>double simple_interest(double principal, double rate, double years)</code> 回傳單利利息，在 main 中計算本金 200,000、年利率 1.8%、持有 2.5 年的利息。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">simple_interest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">years</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">years</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"利息 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">simple_interest</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">200000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.018</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">2.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>利息 = 9000</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-2-1", "sid": "s5-2", "sec": "5.2 參數傳遞：傳值、傳參考、傳指標", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "傳值與傳參考", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>11 12</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>第一次 f(x, y)：a 是 x 的副本（x 不變），b 是 y 的別名，y = 12。第二次 f(y, x)：a 是 y 的副本，b 是 x 的別名，x = 11。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-2-2", "sid": "s5-2", "sec": "5.2 參數傳遞：傳值、傳參考、傳指標", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "選擇傳遞方式", "stem": "<p>函數要讀取一個有 50 萬筆價格的 <code>std::vector&lt;double&gt;</code> 來計算平均，最恰當的形參寫法是？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; p</code>"], ["B", "<code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;p</code>"], ["C", "<code>const std::vector&lt;double&gt; *&amp;p</code>"], ["D", "<code>const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;p</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><code>const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;p</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>const 參考不複製大量資料，又保證函數不會修改它，也能接受臨時物件。(A) 會複製 50 萬筆；(B) 允許修改且不能接受臨時物件；(C) 可行但呼叫時要取位址、還要防範空指標。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-2-3", "sid": "s5-2", "sec": "5.2 參數傳遞：傳值、傳參考、傳指標", "kind": "找錯", "level": "中", "title": "交換失敗", "stem": "<p>下面的交換函數為什麼沒有效果？請修正。</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">swap_rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>形參是傳值，函數只交換了兩個副本，呼叫端的變數不受影響。改成傳參考：</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">swap_rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.05</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">swap_rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0.05 0.02</code></pre>\n<p>（標準程式庫已經有 <code>std::swap(a, b)</code>，在 <code>&lt;utility&gt;</code>。）</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-2-4", "sid": "s5-2", "sec": "5.2 參數傳遞：傳值、傳參考、傳指標", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "一次算出多個統計量", "stem": "<p>寫一個函數 <code>void summary(const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;x, double &amp;mn, double &amp;mx, double &amp;avg)</code>，一次算出最小值、最大值與平均，在 main 中測試 <code>{3.2, -1.5, 4.8, 0.7, 2.1}</code>。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">summary</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">mn</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">mx</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">avg</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mn</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mx</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">avg</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">summary</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"mf\">3.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">-1.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">4.8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.7</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">2.1</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"min \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"，max \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"，avg \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>min -1.5，max 4.8，avg 1.86</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-3-1", "sid": "s5-3", "sec": "5.3 把陣列傳進函數", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "陣列形參", "stem": "<p><code>void f(double a[100]);</code> 這個宣告中，形參 a 的實際型態是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>100 個 double 的陣列</p>"], ["B", "<code>double*</code>"], ["C", "<code>double&amp;</code>"], ["D", "<code>double[100]&amp;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><code>double*</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>陣列形參會被調整成指標，100 只是說明用途，編譯器不檢查，傳任何長度的 double 陣列都可以。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-3-2", "sid": "s5-3", "sec": "5.3 把陣列傳進函數", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "為什麼要傳長度", "stem": "<p>為什麼 C 風格的陣列函數（如 <code>double sum(const double *x, int n)</code>）需要多傳一個 n？在函數裡用 <code>sizeof(x)/sizeof(x[0])</code> 為什麼不行？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>陣列傳進函數時只傳了首元素的位址，形參 x 是指標，函數無法得知陣列的長度。sizeof(x) 量到的是指標的大小（64 位元系統 8 bytes），除以 sizeof(double) 得到 1，跟陣列真正的長度無關。所以長度必須由呼叫端另外傳進來；或者改用 std::vector，它自己記得 size()。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-4-1", "sid": "s5-4", "sec": "5.4 回傳值", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "懸空參考", "stem": "<p>下列哪個函數的回傳是<strong>安全</strong>的？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<code>int&amp; h(std::vector&lt;int&gt; &amp;v) { return v[0]; }</code>"], ["B", "<code>int* g() { int x = 1; return &amp;x; }</code>"], ["C", "<code>int&amp; f() { int x = 1; return x; }</code>"], ["D", "<code>const std::string&amp; k() { std::string s = &quot;a&quot;; return s; }</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><code>int&amp; h(std::vector&lt;int&gt; &amp;v) { return v[0]; }</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>v 是呼叫端傳進來、在呼叫前就存在的物件，回傳它元素的參考是安全的；其他三個都回傳了函數內區域變數的參考或指標，函數結束後就失效。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-4-2", "sid": "s5-4", "sec": "5.4 回傳值", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "回傳參考是左值", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"nf\">last</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">back</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">last</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">last</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>100 3</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>last 回傳最後一個元素的參考，所以可以對呼叫結果賦值：先設成 99，再加 1。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-4-3", "sid": "s5-4", "sec": "5.4 回傳值", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "回傳 vector", "stem": "<p>寫一個函數 <code>std::vector&lt;double&gt; to_returns(const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;price)</code>，把價格序列轉成簡單報酬率序列（長度少 1），在 main 中測試 <code>{100, 102, 99, 105}</code> 並印出結果。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to_returns</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"kt\">size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">push_back</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to_returns</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">102</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">99</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">105</span><span class=\"p\">}))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0.02 -0.0294118 0.0606061</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>在函數裡建立 vector 再回傳（回傳值、不是參考）是安全且有效率的寫法。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-5-1", "sid": "s5-5", "sec": "5.5 變數的生命週期：區域、全域、static", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "static 區域變數", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">counter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">counter</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">counter</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">counter</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>31</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>static 的 n 保留上次的值，第三次呼叫時 n = 3；普通區域變數 m 每次都從 0 開始，永遠是 1。3 × 10 + 1 = 31。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-5-2", "sid": "s5-5", "sec": "5.5 變數的生命週期：區域、全域、static", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "extern", "stem": "<p><code>extern double rate;</code> 這一行的作用是？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>宣告 rate 定義在別處，這裡不配置記憶體</p>"], ["B", "<p>定義 rate、在這裡配置記憶體並初始化為 0</p>"], ["C", "<p>讓 rate 只能在本原始檔中被使用</p>"], ["D", "<p>讓 rate 成為之後不能修改的常數</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>宣告 rate 定義在別處，這裡不配置記憶體</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>extern 宣告只告訴編譯器「有這個變數」，真正的定義（配置記憶體）在其他地方；讓變數只限本檔案使用的是 static。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-6-1", "sid": "s5-6", "sec": "5.6 預設引數、inline 與函數重載", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "預設引數", "stem": "<p>下列哪一個宣告是<strong>錯誤</strong>的？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<code>double f(double a, double b = 1.0);</code>"], ["B", "<code>double f(double a = 0, double b = 1.0);</code>"], ["C", "<code>double f(double a, int n = 1, int m = 2);</code>"], ["D", "<code>double f(double a = 0, double b);</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><code>double f(double a = 0, double b);</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>有預設值的形參必須放在最右邊；a 有預設值而後面的 b 沒有，是錯的。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-6-2", "sid": "s5-6", "sec": "5.6 預設引數、inline 與函數重載", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "重載的條件", "stem": "<p>下列哪一組可以構成合法的函數重載？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p><code>void f(double);</code> 與 <code>void f(double, int);</code></p>"], ["B", "<p><code>void f(int value);</code> 與 <code>void f(int amount);</code></p>"], ["C", "<p><code>int f(int);</code> 與 <code>double f(int);</code></p>"], ["D", "<p><code>void f(int);</code> 與 <code>void f(const int);</code></p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p><code>void f(double);</code> 與 <code>void f(double, int);</code></p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>形參個數不同可以重載。(C) 只差回傳型態；(B) 只差形參名稱；(D) 只差 Top-Level const，三者都被視為重複宣告。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-6-3", "sid": "s5-6", "sec": "5.6 預設引數、inline 與函數重載", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "重載報酬率函數", "stem": "<p>寫兩個同名函數 <code>ret</code>：<code>double ret(double p0, double p1)</code> 回傳單期報酬率；<code>double ret(const std::vector&lt;double&gt; &amp;p)</code> 回傳整段期間的累積報酬率（期末 / 期初 − 1）。測試 <code>ret(50, 55)</code> 與 <code>ret({50, 52, 49, 55, 60})</code>。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">ret</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">ret</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ret</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">front</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">back</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"c1\">// 重用第一個版本</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ret</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">55</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ret</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"mi\">50</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">52</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">49</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">55</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">})</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0.1 0.2</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-7-1", "sid": "s5-7", "sec": "5.7 遞迴：函數呼叫自己", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "遞迴", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2330</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>8</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>f 計算各位數字的和：0 + 3 + 3 + 2 = 8。每次取個位數 n % 10，再把剩下的 n / 10 交給下一層，直到 n 為 0。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-8-1", "sid": "s5-8", "sec": "5.8 函數也是資料：函數指標、lambda、std::function", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "函數指標宣告", "stem": "<p>要宣告一個指標 pf，可以指向 <code>double bs_call(double S, double K, double T)</code> 這種函數，正確的寫法是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<code>double *pf(double, double, double);</code>"], ["B", "<code>double (*pf)(double, double, double);</code>"], ["C", "<code>double (&amp;pf)(double, double, double);</code>"], ["D", "<code>(double*) pf(double, double, double);</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><code>double (*pf)(double, double, double);</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>把函數名稱換成 (<em>pf)。(A) 少了括號，變成宣告一個回傳 double</em> 的函數；(C) 是函數的參考。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-8-2", "sid": "s5-8", "sec": "5.8 函數也是資料：函數指標、lambda、std::function", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "lambda 捕捉", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">auto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">]()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>17</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>a 以值捕捉，存的是建立 lambda 當下的 1；b 以參考捕捉，呼叫時看到最新的 7。1 × 10 + 7 = 17。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-8-3", "sid": "s5-8", "sec": "5.8 函數也是資料：函數指標、lambda、std::function", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "用 lambda 篩選", "stem": "<p>給定股票本益比 <code>{8.5, 22.1, 15.3, 31.0, 11.2, 18.7}</code>，用 <code>std::count_if</code> 搭配捕捉了 <code>lo</code>、<code>hi</code> 兩個變數的 lambda，算出本益比介於 10 與 20 之間的檔數。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">8.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">22.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">15.3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">31.0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">11.2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">18.7</span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">count_if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">pe</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">begin</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pe</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">end</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                          </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"p\">](</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hi</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">});</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" 檔</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>3 檔</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>lo、hi 只需要讀取，以值捕捉即可；換成別的區間只要改兩個變數，lambda 不用動。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch05", "id": "q-s5-8-4", "sid": "s5-8", "sec": "5.8 函數也是資料：函數指標、lambda、std::function", "kind": "簡答", "level": "難", "title": "函數當參數的好處", "stem": "<p>「通用二分法」函數 <code>bisect(f, lo, hi)</code> 把要求根的函數當作參數傳入。相較於每個問題各寫一次二分法，這樣設計有什麼好處？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>求根的演算法（區間砍半、判斷正負號、停止條件）只寫一次、測試一次，就能套用在任何單變數方程：殖利率、IRR、隱含波動度、損益兩平點等。問題本身由呼叫端用 lambda 描述，演算法與問題分離，程式碼不重複、更容易維護；要換成牛頓法，也只要換掉求根函數，不用改問題的描述。</p></div>", "ch": "第 5 章　函數"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-1-1", "sid": "s6-1", "sec": "6.1 命名空間 namespace", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "作用域運算子", "stem": "<p>命名空間 <code>risk</code> 中有函數 <code>var()</code>，在 main 中要呼叫它，正確寫法是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>risk.var()</code>"], ["B", "<code>risk-&gt;var()</code>"], ["C", "<code>risk::var()</code>"], ["D", "<code>var::risk()</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>risk::var()</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>存取命名空間的成員用作用域運算子 ::；<code>.</code> 和 <code>-&gt;</code> 是存取物件成員。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-1-2", "sid": "s6-1", "sec": "6.1 命名空間 namespace", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "using namespace", "stem": "<p>為什麼不建議在標頭檔中寫 <code>using namespace std;</code>？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>標頭檔會被許多 .cpp include，標頭檔中的 using namespace std 會把 std 的所有名稱帶進每一個 include 它的檔案的全域範圍，使用者無法拒絕。std 的名稱非常多（count、distance、data、size…），很容易和使用者自己的變數或函數撞名，造成難以理解的編譯錯誤或呼叫到錯誤的版本。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-2-1", "sid": "s6-2", "sec": "6.2 前置處理器：#define、#include、條件編譯", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "巨集展開", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#define DOUBLE(x) x + x</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DOUBLE</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>33</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>巨集只做文字替換：DOUBLE(3) * 10 展開成 3 + 3 * 10 = 33，不是 60。應寫成 <code>#define DOUBLE(x) ((x) + (x))</code>，或乾脆用 inline 函數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-2-2", "sid": "s6-2", "sec": "6.2 前置處理器：#define、#include、條件編譯", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "include guard", "stem": "<p>include guard（<code>#ifndef X_H / #define X_H / ... / #endif</code>）的目的是？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>讓標頭檔編譯得比較快</p>"], ["B", "<p>隱藏標頭檔中的變數與函數，讓其他檔案看不到</p>"], ["C", "<p>讓標頭檔只能被一個 .cpp 使用</p>"], ["D", "<p>避免同一個標頭檔在一個原始檔中被重複貼入</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>避免同一個標頭檔在一個原始檔中被重複貼入</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>第一次 include 時定義了 X_H，之後再被 include（例如透過其他標頭檔間接引入）時，#ifndef 不成立，整段內容被跳過，避免重複定義。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-2-3", "sid": "s6-2", "sec": "6.2 前置處理器：#define、#include、條件編譯", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "<> 與 \"\"", "stem": "<p>自己寫的標頭檔 <code>pricing.h</code> 放在專案資料夾中，應該怎麼 include？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<code>#include &quot;pricing.h&quot;</code>"], ["B", "<code>#include &lt;pricing.h&gt;</code>"], ["C", "<code>#include pricing.h</code>"], ["D", "<code>#import &quot;pricing.h&quot;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><code>#include &quot;pricing.h&quot;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>雙引號會先在目前目錄搜尋；角括號直接到系統目錄找，通常用於標準程式庫。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-3-1", "sid": "s6-3", "sec": "6.3 記憶體的分區", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "記憶體分區", "stem": "<p>函數內的 <code>static double cache = 0;</code> 存放在哪個區域？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>堆疊</p>"], ["B", "<p>堆積</p>"], ["C", "<p>全域／靜態儲存區</p>"], ["D", "<p>常數儲存區（和字串字面值放一起）</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>全域／靜態儲存區</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>static 區域變數和全域變數一樣放在靜態儲存區，整個程式期間都存在，只是只有該函數看得到。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-4-1", "sid": "s6-4", "sec": "6.4 new 與 delete：手動管理堆積", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "new 與 delete 配對", "stem": "<p><code>double *a = new double[100];</code> 應該用哪一行釋放？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<code>delete a;</code>"], ["B", "<code>delete[] a;</code>"], ["C", "<code>free(a);</code>"], ["D", "<p>不需要釋放，函數結束會自動回收</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><code>delete[] a;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>new[] 必須配 delete[]；用 delete 釋放陣列是未定義行為；堆積上的記憶體不會因為指標離開作用域而自動釋放。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-4-2", "sid": "s6-4", "sec": "6.4 new 與 delete：手動管理堆積", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "記憶體洩漏", "stem": "<p>在函數中寫 <code>int *p = new int(5);</code>，函數結束時沒有 delete。說明函數結束後「什麼被銷毀了」、「什麼沒有」。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>指標變數 p 本身是區域變數，存放在堆疊上，函數結束時被銷毀；但 p 指向的那個 int 是用 new 配置在堆積上的，不會自動釋放。由於已經沒有任何指標記得它的位址，這塊記憶體再也無法被 delete，造成記憶體洩漏。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-5-1", "sid": "s6-5", "sec": "6.5 智慧指標：讓物件自己收拾", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "智慧指標選擇", "stem": "<p>一個模擬函數要建立一大塊路徑資料並交給呼叫端，資料只會有一個擁有者。最適合的回傳型態是？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<code>double*</code>"], ["B", "<code>std::weak_ptr&lt;Paths&gt;</code>"], ["C", "<code>std::shared_ptr&lt;Paths&gt;</code>"], ["D", "<code>std::unique_ptr&lt;Paths&gt;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><code>std::unique_ptr&lt;Paths&gt;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>單一擁有者用 unique_ptr，回傳時擁有權直接移交給呼叫端，離開作用域自動釋放。裸指標要靠呼叫端記得 delete；shared_ptr 有不必要的計數成本；weak_ptr 不擁有物件。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-5-2", "sid": "s6-5", "sec": "6.5 智慧指標：讓物件自己收拾", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "參考計數", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;memory&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">auto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">make_shared</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.5</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">auto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">shared_ptr</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">use_count</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">reset</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">use_count</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>3 2 1.5</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>a、b、c 共用同一物件，計數 3；b.reset() 後剩 a、c，計數 2，物件仍存在。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-5-3", "sid": "s6-5", "sec": "6.5 智慧指標：讓物件自己收拾", "kind": "找錯", "level": "難", "title": "重複擁有", "stem": "<p>下面程式有什麼問題？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">shared_ptr</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r1</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">shared_ptr</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r2</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">raw</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>r1 和 r2 都從同一個裸指標建立，各自擁有一個獨立的參考計數，彼此不知道對方存在。當兩者都離開作用域時，會各 delete 一次同一塊記憶體（重複釋放），屬於未定義行為。應該寫成 <code>auto r1 = std::make_shared&lt;double&gt;(0.02); auto r2 = r1;</code>，讓它們共用同一個計數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch06", "id": "q-s6-6-1", "sid": "s6-6", "sec": "6.6 補充：讀寫檔案", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "讀檔計算平均", "stem": "<p>修改上面的程式：讀入 prices.csv 後，計算平均收盤價與最大成交量，印出來。（先寫檔再讀檔，讓程式可以獨立執行。）</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;string&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">ofstream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"prices.csv\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">out</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"date,close,volume</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">2026-11-09,1005.0,32100</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">2026-11-10,1012.5,28750</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"2026-11-11,998.0,41230</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">2026-11-12,1015.0,35020</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">ifstream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">in</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"prices.csv\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">getline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">in</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">long</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">long</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max_vol</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">while</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">getline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">in</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stringstream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">line</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">getline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">','</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">getline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">','</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">getline</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ss</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">','</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stod</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">long</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">long</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vol</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">stoll</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">vol</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max_vol</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max_vol</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vol</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"平均收盤 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sum</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"，最大成交量 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">max_vol</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>平均收盤 1007.62，最大成交量 41230</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 6 章　命名空間、預處理與記憶體管理"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-1-1", "sid": "s7-1", "sec": "7.1 類別與物件", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "class 與 struct", "stem": "<p>在 C++ 中，<code>class</code> 和 <code>struct</code> 最主要的差別是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>struct 裡面不能定義任何成員函數</p>"], ["B", "<p>兩者成員預設的存取權限不同</p>"], ["C", "<p>class 的物件一定會被配置在堆積上</p>"], ["D", "<p>struct 只能宣告，不能被實例化成物件</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>兩者成員預設的存取權限不同</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>C++ 的 struct 與 class 幾乎完全相同，只差在預設存取權：class 為 private、struct 為 public（繼承時的預設等級也一樣不同）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-1-2", "sid": "s7-1", "sec": "7.1 類別與物件", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "封裝", "stem": "<p>把 <code>balance</code> 設為 private、只提供 <code>deposit()</code> 與 <code>get_balance()</code> 的主要好處是？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>只能經由有檢查的介面修改，且實作可自由調整</p>"], ["B", "<p>存取 private 成員的程式執行速度比較快</p>"], ["C", "<p>private 成員不佔用物件的記憶體空間</p>"], ["D", "<p>有 private 成員的類別就不需要建構函數</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>只能經由有檢查的介面修改，且實作可自由調整</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>封裝的目的是保護資料的正確性（只能經由介面修改）並隔離介面與實作。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-2-1", "sid": "s7-2", "sec": "7.2 把類別拆成 .h 與 .cpp", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "類別外實作", "stem": "<p><code>Bond</code> 類別中宣告了 <code>double price(double y);</code>，在 Bond.cpp 中實作它的正確開頭是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>double price(double y) {</code>"], ["B", "<code>double Bond.price(double y) {</code>"], ["C", "<code>double Bond::price(double y) {</code>"], ["D", "<code>Bond::double price(double y) {</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>double Bond::price(double y) {</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>在類別外實作成員函數要寫 <code>回傳型態 類別名::函數名(參數)</code>。(A) 會變成定義一個與 Bond 無關的普通函數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-3-1", "sid": "s7-3", "sec": "7.3 建構函數", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "建構函數", "stem": "<p>關於建構函數，下列何者<strong>錯誤</strong>？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>名稱與類別名稱相同</p>"], ["B", "<p>建立物件時由系統自動呼叫</p>"], ["C", "<p>必須宣告回傳型態 void</p>"], ["D", "<p>可以重載，同一個類別能有多個建構函數版本</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>必須宣告回傳型態 void</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>建構函數沒有回傳型態，連 void 都不能寫。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-3-2", "sid": "s7-3", "sec": "7.3 建構函數", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "預設建構函數", "stem": "<p>類別 <code>Option</code> 只寫了 <code>Option(double K, double T)</code> 這個建構函數，則 <code>Option op;</code> 會？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>呼叫編譯器自動產生的那個預設建構函數，成員都是 0</p>"], ["B", "<p>編譯錯誤，因為沒有可用的預設建構函數</p>"], ["C", "<p>K 與 T 自動設為 0</p>"], ["D", "<p>可以編譯，但執行時才發生錯誤</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>編譯錯誤，因為沒有可用的預設建構函數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>一旦自己定義了任何建構函數，編譯器就不再自動產生預設建構函數。需要的話可以加 <code>Option() = default;</code> 或自己寫一個。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-3-3", "sid": "s7-3", "sec": "7.3 建構函數", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "初始化列表", "stem": "<p>下列哪一種成員<strong>必須</strong>在建構函數的初始化列表中初始化？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>int count;</code>"], ["B", "<code>double rate;</code>"], ["C", "<code>const double strike;</code>"], ["D", "<code>std::vector&lt;std::string&gt; names;</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>const double strike;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>const 成員與參考成員必須在誕生時就給值，只能在初始化列表（或類別內初始值）設定，無法在函數體內賦值。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-3-4", "sid": "s7-3", "sec": "7.3 建構函數", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "難", "title": "初始化順序", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">show</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b_</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">show</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>通常會印出 <code>0</code>（結果其實是未定義的）。</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>成員依<strong>宣告順序</strong>初始化：a_ 先於 b_。初始化 a_ 時 b_ 還沒有值（垃圾值），所以 a_ 不等於 2 × 5。初始化列表的書寫順序不影響實際順序；編譯器會用 -Wreorder 警告。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-3-5", "sid": "s7-3", "sec": "7.3 建構函數", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "帶建構函數的類別", "stem": "<p>寫一個類別 <code>Deposit</code>（定存），private 成員為本金、年利率、年數；用初始化列表的建構函數設定，並提供 <code>double maturity() const</code> 回傳到期本利和（年複利）。建立 100 萬、1.7%、3 年的定存並印出到期金額。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;cmath&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Deposit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Deposit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">years</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">principal</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">years_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">years</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">maturity</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">std::pow</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate_</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">years_</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">principal_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">years_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Deposit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1000000</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.017</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"到期本利和 = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">maturity</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>到期本利和 = 1051872</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-4-1", "sid": "s7-4", "sec": "7.4 const 成員函數、mutable、this", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "const 物件", "stem": "<p>函數參數寫成 <code>void report(const Portfolio &amp;p)</code>，在函數裡可以呼叫 p 的哪些成員函數？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>所有 public 成員函數，不論有沒有 const</p>"], ["B", "<p>只有宣告為 const 的成員函數</p>"], ["C", "<p>只有 static 成員函數</p>"], ["D", "<p>不能呼叫任何成員函數</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>只有宣告為 const 的成員函數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>透過 const 參考看到的物件是 const 的，只能呼叫保證不修改物件的 const 成員函數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-4-2", "sid": "s7-4", "sec": "7.4 const 成員函數、mutable、this", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "鏈式呼叫", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Counter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Counter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"k\">this</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Counter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add_copy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">k</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"k\">this</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Counter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_copy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">add_copy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">20</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>13</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>add 回傳參考，鏈中每一步都作用在 c 上：n = 3。add_copy 回傳的是副本：第一個 add_copy(10) 改到 c（n = 13），但回傳的是一個副本，第二個 add_copy(20) 加在副本上，c 不受影響。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-5-1", "sid": "s7-5", "sec": "7.5 static 成員：屬於類別，不屬於物件", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "static 成員變數", "stem": "<p>類別中宣告了 <code>static int count;</code>，下列敘述何者正確？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>所有物件共用一份 count，且需要在類別外定義一次</p>"], ["B", "<p>每個物件各有一份 count，彼此獨立互不影響，各自初始化</p>"], ["C", "<p>count 只能在 static 成員函數中被讀取或修改</p>"], ["D", "<p>count 在第一個物件建立時才配置記憶體</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>所有物件共用一份 count，且需要在類別外定義一次</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>static 成員變數屬於類別，全部物件共用；類別內只是宣告，需在某個 .cpp 中定義（C++17 可用 inline static 在類別內定義）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-5-2", "sid": "s7-5", "sec": "7.5 static 成員：屬於類別，不屬於物件", "kind": "找錯", "level": "中", "title": "static 函數", "stem": "<p>下面的 static 成員函數為什麼無法編譯？要怎麼改？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Portfolio</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">print</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>static 成員函數沒有 this 指標，不屬於任何物件，因此無法直接存取非 static 成員 value。改法一：拿掉 static，讓它成為一般成員函數；改法二：把物件當參數傳入：<code>static void print(const Portfolio &amp;p) { std::cout &lt;&lt; p.value &lt;&lt; &quot;\\n&quot;; }</code>。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-5-3", "sid": "s7-5", "sec": "7.5 static 成員：屬於類別，不屬於物件", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "物件計數", "stem": "<p>寫一個類別 <code>Option</code>，用 static 成員變數記錄「目前存在幾個 Option 物件」：建構時 +1、解構時 −1（解構函數寫法：<code>~Option() { ... }</code>），並提供 static 成員函數 <code>alive()</code> 回傳數量。在 main 中建立 2 個物件、在一個區塊中再建立 1 個，分別印出數量。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">alive_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">~</span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">alive_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alive</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alive_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alive_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">alive_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">alive</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">alive</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">alive</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>2\n3\n2</code></pre></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-6-1", "sid": "s7-6", "sec": "7.6 運算子重載", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "運算子重載", "stem": "<p>關於運算子重載，下列何者<strong>正確</strong>？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>重載的運算子本質上是一個特殊名稱的函數</p>"], ["B", "<p>可以把 <code>+</code> 的優先順序改成高於 <code>*</code></p>"], ["C", "<p>可以自創新的運算子，例如次方用的 <code>**</code></p>"], ["D", "<p>可以重新定義兩個 int 相加時的運算結果</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>重載的運算子本質上是一個特殊名稱的函數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>運算子重載只能重新定義既有運算子用在自訂型態上的意義，不能創造新運算子、改變優先順序，也不能改變內建型態之間的運算。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-6-2", "sid": "s7-6", "sec": "7.6 運算子重載", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "利率的比較與輸出", "stem": "<p>寫一個類別 <code>Rate</code>（存一個年利率 double），重載 <code>&lt;</code> 用來比較大小，並重載 <code>&lt;&lt;</code> 讓它以百分比、兩位小數印出（例如 <code>1.75%</code>）。用 <code>std::sort</code> 對 <code>std::vector&lt;Rate&gt;</code> 排序後印出。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">explicit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">operator</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">o</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">r_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">ostream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"k\">operator</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">ostream</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">fixed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">setprecision</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.0175</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.012</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.031</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.0225</span><span class=\"p\">)};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">sort</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">begin</span><span class=\"p\">(),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">end</span><span class=\"p\">());</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// sort 用 &lt; 比較</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>1.20% 1.75% 2.25% 3.10%</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>std::sort 預設用 <code>&lt;</code> 比較元素，所以只要類別重載了 <code>&lt;</code>，就能直接排序。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-7-1", "sid": "s7-7", "sec": "7.7 物件的一生：複製與解構", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "複製建構與複製賦值", "stem": "<p>下列哪一行呼叫的是<strong>複製賦值運算子</strong>？（a、b 都是 Bond 物件）</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<code>Bond c = a;</code>"], ["B", "<code>Bond d(a);</code>"], ["C", "<code>b = a;</code>"], ["D", "<code>Bond e{a};</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><code>b = a;</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>b 已經存在，<code>b = a</code> 是把 a 的內容賦值給 b；其他三個都是在建立新物件，呼叫複製建構函數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-7-2", "sid": "s7-7", "sec": "7.7 物件的一生：複製與解構", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "解構順序", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">~</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"p\">)(</span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'a'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'b'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'c'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sc\">'d'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>abcCBdDA</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>建構時印小寫、解構時印大寫（c − 32 轉大寫）。區塊內 b、c 建構後，離開區塊依相反順序解構：C、B。接著 d 建構；main 結束時 d、a 依相反順序解構：D、A。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-7-3", "sid": "s7-7", "sec": "7.7 物件的一生：複製與解構", "kind": "簡答", "level": "難", "title": "淺複製", "stem": "<p>一個類別用 <code>int *data</code> 指向 <code>new</code> 出來的記憶體，並在解構函數中 <code>delete data</code>，但沒有定義複製建構函數。說明 <code>MyClass b = a;</code> 之後會發生哪些問題。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>編譯器產生的複製建構函數逐一複製成員，b.data 得到的是 a.data 的位址（淺複製），兩個物件共用同一塊記憶體。問題有三：(1) 修改 b 指向的資料會同時改到 a；(2) 其中一個物件先解構時 delete 了這塊記憶體，另一個物件的指標變成懸空指標；(3) 另一個物件解構時又 delete 一次，造成重複釋放。解法是自己定義深複製的複製建構函數與複製賦值運算子，或改用 vector／智慧指標管理資源。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch07", "id": "q-s7-8-1", "sid": "s7-8", "sec": "7.8 綜合範例：一個完整的 Bond 類別", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "難", "title": "擴充 Bond", "stem": "<p>替上面的 Bond 加上 <code>double convexity(double ytm) const</code>（用數值近似：\\(C \\approx \\dfrac{P(y-h) + P(y+h) - 2P(y)}{P(y)\\,h^2}\\)，取 \\(h = 0.0001\\)），並用「修正存續期間＋凸性」估計殖利率上升 100bp 時的價格變動百分比：\\(\\Delta P/P \\approx -D_{mod}\\,\\Delta y + \\tfrac12 C\\,(\\Delta y)^2\\)。只需寫出新增的成員函數與 main 中的計算。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">\"Bond.h\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">// 不修改 Bond.h 的前提下，先寫成一個使用 Bond 公開介面的普通函數</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">convexity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.0001</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Bond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"TW10Y\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.0175</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.01</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">modified_duration</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">convexity</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">approx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.5</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dy</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"D = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"，C = \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"近似變動 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">approx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%，實際變動 \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>D = 9.06874，C = 95.2263\n近似變動 -8.59261%，實際變動 -8.61047%</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>因為 price 是 public 的 const 成員函數，不改類別也能寫出凸性；若要做成成員函數，就在 Bond.h 加宣告 <code>double convexity(double ytm) const;</code>，在 Bond.cpp 寫 <code>double Bond::convexity(double y) const { ... }</code>。「與類別相關但不需要存取 private」的功能寫成普通函數也是老師講義提到的做法。</p></div>", "ch": "第 7 章　類別 class（一）：封裝、建構與物件的一生"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-1-1", "sid": "s8-1", "sec": "8.1 繼承：子類別沿用父類別", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "易", "title": "建構與解構順序", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"A\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">~</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"B\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">~</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"b\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"|\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>AB|ba</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>先建構父類別 A、再建構子類別 B；main 結束時先解構 B、再解構 A。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-1-2", "sid": "s8-1", "sec": "8.1 繼承：子類別沿用父類別", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "protected", "stem": "<p>父類別的 <code>protected</code> 成員可以被誰直接存取？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>任何地方</p>"], ["B", "<p>只有父類別自己</p>"], ["C", "<p>只有子類別，父類別自己反而不行</p>"], ["D", "<p>父類別自己與它的子類別</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>父類別自己與它的子類別</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>protected 介於 public 與 private 之間：對外界隱藏，但開放給子類別使用。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-1-3", "sid": "s8-1", "sec": "8.1 繼承：子類別沿用父類別", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "繼承方式", "stem": "<p><code>class D : private B {...};</code> 之後，B 的 public 成員在 D 中的等級是？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>public</p>"], ["B", "<p>protected</p>"], ["C", "<p>private</p>"], ["D", "<p>無法存取</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>private</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>private 繼承會把父類別的 public 與 protected 成員都變成子類別的 private 成員；父類別的 private 成員則不論哪種繼承都無法直接存取。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-2-1", "sid": "s8-2", "sec": "8.2 覆寫、虛函數與多型", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "virtual 的有無", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">a</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Ba \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">virtual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">b</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Bb \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">virtual</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">~</span><span class=\"n\">Base</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">default</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"k\">struct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Der</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">a</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Da \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">b</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">override</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"Db \"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Der</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>Ba Db Da Db</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>a 不是虛函數，透過 Base&amp; 呼叫時看參考的型態，執行 Base::a；b 是虛函數，依物件的實際型態執行 Der::b。直接用 d 呼叫則都是 Der 的版本。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-2-2", "sid": "s8-2", "sec": "8.2 覆寫、虛函數與多型", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "override 關鍵字", "stem": "<p>在子類別函數後面加上 <code>override</code> 的作用是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>讓該函數變成虛函數，啟動多型</p>"], ["B", "<p>要求編譯器檢查它確實覆寫了父類別的虛函數</p>"], ["C", "<p>讓子類別可以存取父類別的 private 成員</p>"], ["D", "<p>讓父類別的同名函數被刪除</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>要求編譯器檢查它確實覆寫了父類別的虛函數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>override 是編譯期檢查：若父類別沒有簽名相符的虛函數，就報錯，避免因為少了 const 或參數型態不同而「以為覆寫了其實沒有」。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-2-3", "sid": "s8-2", "sec": "8.2 覆寫、虛函數與多型", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "多型的好處", "stem": "<p>投資組合程式用 <code>std::vector&lt;std::unique_ptr&lt;Instrument&gt;&gt;</code> 存放各種商品，並用迴圈呼叫 <code>ins-&gt;npv()</code> 加總。若之後要新增「利率交換」商品，需要修改哪些程式碼？這體現了多型的什麼好處？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>只需要新增一個繼承 Instrument 並覆寫 npv()（以及其他虛函數）的 Swap 子類別，再把它放進容器即可；加總市值的迴圈、報表等使用 Instrument 介面的程式碼完全不需修改。這體現了多型「對擴充開放、對修改封閉」的好處：使用端只依賴共同的介面，新的實作可以直接插入。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-3-1", "sid": "s8-3", "sec": "8.3 覆寫、遮蔽與重載", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "遮蔽", "stem": "<p>父類別有 <code>void calc(int);</code> 與 <code>void calc(int, int);</code>，子類別只定義了 <code>void calc(double);</code>，則 <code>child.calc(1, 2);</code> 會？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>呼叫父類別的 calc(int, int)</p>"], ["B", "<p>執行期才決定呼叫哪一個</p>"], ["C", "<p>呼叫子類別的 calc(double)</p>"], ["D", "<p>編譯錯誤，父類別的 calc 被遮蔽</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>編譯錯誤，父類別的 calc 被遮蔽</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>名稱查找在子類別找到 calc 後就停止，父類別所有的 calc 都被遮蔽；子類別的 calc(double) 只接受一個參數，因此編譯失敗。在子類別加上 <code>using Parent::calc;</code> 即可。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-4-1", "sid": "s8-4", "sec": "8.4 抽象類別與虛解構函數", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "抽象類別", "stem": "<p>類別中含有 <code>virtual double npv() const = 0;</code>，則下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>這個類別可以直接建立物件，npv 回傳 0</p>"], ["B", "<p>這個類別是抽象類別，不能建立物件</p>"], ["C", "<p>子類別不能覆寫 npv</p>"], ["D", "<p><code>= 0</code> 表示 npv 的預設回傳值是 0</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>這個類別是抽象類別，不能建立物件</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p><code>= 0</code> 宣告純虛函數，含有純虛函數的類別是抽象類別，只能作為父類別；子類別必須實作 npv 才能建立物件。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-4-2", "sid": "s8-4", "sec": "8.4 抽象類別與虛解構函數", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "虛解構函數", "stem": "<p><code>Instrument *p = new Swap(...); delete p;</code> 若 Instrument 的解構函數不是 virtual，會發生什麼事？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>delete 時依指標型態 Instrument* 決定呼叫哪個解構函數，只會執行 Instrument 的解構函數，Swap 的解構函數不會被呼叫，Swap 自己持有的資源（例如動態配置的現金流表）不會被釋放，造成資源洩漏；依標準這是未定義行為。只要把父類別的解構函數宣告為 virtual 就能正確地先解構子類別、再解構父類別。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-5-1", "sid": "s8-5", "sec": "8.5 QuantLib 風格：策略模式與定價引擎", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "難", "title": "新增一個引擎", "stem": "<p>在上面的架構中新增一個 <code>SpreadBondEngine</code>：它持有一條曲線和一個信用利差 s，折現因子用 <code>curve-&gt;discount(t) * exp(-s * t)</code>。用平坦 2.5% 曲線加上 150bp 利差計算同一張債券的 NPV。（只需寫出新的類別與 main 中的使用方式；可以把上面的程式整段複製後加上去。）</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">SpreadBondEngine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">PricingEngine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"k\">public</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">SpreadBondEngine</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">shared_ptr</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">YieldCurve</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">spread</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">move</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">curve</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s_</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">spread</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">calculate</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">bond</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">override</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bond</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cashflows</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">npv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"kt\">size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cf</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1.0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">npv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cf</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve_</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">discount</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">exp</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">s_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">npv</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"k\">private</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">shared_ptr</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">YieldCurve</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s_</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">};</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">// main 中：</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// bond.setPricingEngine(std::make_shared&lt;SpreadBondEngine&gt;(flat, 0.015));</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">// std::cout &lt;&lt; bond.NPV() &lt;&lt; \"\\n\";</span>\n</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>Bond 類別一行都不用改，只要多一個覆寫 calculate 的子類別——這正是策略模式的價值。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-6-1", "sid": "s8-6", "sec": "8.6 friend：開放給特定的朋友", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "friend", "stem": "<p>關於友函數，下列何者<strong>錯誤</strong>？</p>", "key": "C", "opts": [["A", "<p>可以存取該類別的 private 成員</p>"], ["B", "<p>在類別內用 friend 宣告</p>"], ["C", "<p>它是該類別的成員函數，有 this 指標</p>"], ["D", "<p>friend 關係不會被子類別繼承，也不是雙向的</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (C)</strong><p>它是該類別的成員函數，有 this 指標</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>友函數是被授權的非成員函數，沒有 this 指標，呼叫時也不需要透過物件。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-7-1", "sid": "s8-7", "sec": "8.7 多重繼承與虛擬繼承", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "虛擬繼承", "stem": "<p>B、C 都繼承 A，D 同時繼承 B 和 C。在 B、C 使用 <code>virtual public A</code> 的目的是？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>讓 A 的函數都變成虛函數</p>"], ["B", "<p>讓 B 和 C 可以存取 A 的 private 成員</p>"], ["C", "<p>讓 D 不能建立物件</p>"], ["D", "<p>讓 D 物件中只有一份 A 子物件</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>讓 D 物件中只有一份 A 子物件</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>虛擬繼承讓菱形結構中共同的基底類別只保留一份，解決重複與歧義的問題；它和虛函數是不同的概念。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch08", "id": "q-s8-8-1", "sid": "s8-8", "sec": "8.8 設計模式：單例（Singleton）", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "單例的實作", "stem": "<p>單例模式的實作中，為什麼要把建構函數設為 private，又要把複製建構函數與複製賦值運算子設為 <code>= delete</code>？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>建構函數設為 private，外界就不能用 <code>Settings s;</code> 或 <code>new Settings</code> 自己建立物件，只能透過 static 的 instance() 取得唯一的那一個；但即使不能直接建構，若允許複製，仍可以用 <code>Settings s2 = Settings::instance();</code> 複製出第二個物件，所以要把複製建構與複製賦值都刪除，才能保證整個程式只有一個實例。</p></div>", "ch": "第 8 章　類別 class（二）：繼承、多型與設計模式"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-1-1", "sid": "s9-1", "sec": "9.1 為什麼需要模板", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "模板的本質", "stem": "<p>關於函數模板，下列何者正確？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>程式執行時才決定 T 到底是什麼型態</p>"], ["B", "<p>編譯器依實際型態，產生出真正的函數</p>"], ["C", "<p>每次呼叫模板函數都比一般函數來得慢</p>"], ["D", "<p>模板只能搭配 int 與 double 這兩種型態</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>編譯器依實際型態，產生出真正的函數</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>模板是藍圖，編譯期依實際型態產生具體函數；產生出來的函數和手寫的一樣快。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-2-1", "sid": "s9-2", "sec": "9.2 函數模板", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "推論失敗", "stem": "<p><code>template &lt;typename T&gt; T mul(T a, T b);</code> 之下，<code>mul(2, 1.5)</code> 為什麼無法編譯？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>兩個實參推論出的 T 不一致</p>"], ["B", "<p>模板函數的參數不能直接傳字面值</p>"], ["C", "<p>mul 這個名稱是 C++ 的保留字</p>"], ["D", "<p>呼叫模板函數時一定要寫出角括號</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>兩個實參推論出的 T 不一致</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>第一個實參推論出 T = int、第二個推論出 T = double，同一個 T 不能同時是兩種型態。可以寫 mul<double>(2, 1.5)，或把模板改成兩個型態參數。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-2-2", "sid": "s9-2", "sec": "9.2 函數模板", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "非型態參數", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">template</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"k\">typename</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">T</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">scale</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">scale</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">scale</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>4.5 70</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>第一個實例化 T = double、K = 3；第二個 T = int、K = 10。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-2-3", "sid": "s9-2", "sec": "9.2 函數模板", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "中", "title": "通用的加權平均", "stem": "<p>寫一個函數模板 <code>weighted_mean(const std::vector&lt;T&gt; &amp;x, const std::vector&lt;T&gt; &amp;w)</code> 回傳加權平均（Σwx / Σw），分別用 <code>double</code> 與 <code>float</code> 測試：報酬 {0.08, 0.12, 0.03}、權重 {0.5, 0.3, 0.2}。</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;vector&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">template</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"k\">typename</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">T</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">weighted_mean</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">vector</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"p\">{},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">den</span><span class=\"p\">{};</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"kt\">size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">size</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">den</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">num</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">den</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">weighted_mean</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">double</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"mf\">0.08</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.12</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.03</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">0.5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.2</span><span class=\"p\">})</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">weighted_mean</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"mf\">0.08f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.12f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.03f</span><span class=\"p\">},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"mf\">0.5f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.3f</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.2f</span><span class=\"p\">})</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0.082\n0.082</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>用 <code>{...}</code> 傳入時編譯器無法從初始化列表推論 T，所以要明確寫 <code>&lt;double&gt;</code>；若先宣告好 vector 變數再傳，就能自動推論。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-3-1", "sid": "s9-3", "sec": "9.3 類別模板", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "類別外定義", "stem": "<p>類別模板 <code>template &lt;typename T&gt; class Curve</code> 中宣告了 <code>T rate(double t) const;</code>，在類別外定義它的正確寫法是？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<code>T Curve::rate(double t) const { ... }</code>"], ["B", "<code>template &lt;typename T&gt; T Curve&lt;T&gt;::rate(double t) const { ... }</code>"], ["C", "<code>template &lt;typename T&gt; T Curve::rate&lt;T&gt;(double t) const { ... }</code>"], ["D", "<code>T Curve&lt;T&gt;::rate(double t) const { ... }</code>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><code>template &lt;typename T&gt; T Curve&lt;T&gt;::rate(double t) const { ... }</code></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>類別外定義要重新宣告 template <typename T>，並用 Curve<T>:: 指明是哪個類別模板的成員。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-3-2", "sid": "s9-3", "sec": "9.3 類別模板", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "局部特化", "stem": "<p>下列哪一項<strong>不被</strong> C++ 允許？</p>", "key": "D", "opts": [["A", "<p>類別模板的全特化</p>"], ["B", "<p>類別模板的局部特化</p>"], ["C", "<p>函數模板的全特化</p>"], ["D", "<p>函數模板的局部特化</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (D)</strong><p>函數模板的局部特化</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>函數模板只能全特化；需要類似局部特化的效果時，用函數重載。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-4-1", "sid": "s9-4", "sec": "9.4 typename、成員函數模板與別名", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "typename 的必要性", "stem": "<p>在模板中寫 <code>T::iterator it;</code> 為什麼可能編譯失敗？要怎麼修正？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>T::iterator 依賴模板參數 T，編譯器在看到模板定義時還不知道 T 是什麼，無法判斷 T::iterator 是型態還是靜態成員變數，預設會當成值來解析，於是 <code>T::iterator it;</code> 變成不合法的語法。修正方式是加上 typename，明確告訴編譯器它是型態：<code>typename T::iterator it;</code>（或改用 <code>auto it = c.begin();</code>）。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-4-2", "sid": "s9-4", "sec": "9.4 typename、成員函數模板與別名", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "成員函數模板", "stem": "<p>為什麼成員函數模板不能宣告為 virtual？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>虛函數表無法預先列出所有實例化版本</p>"], ["B", "<p>模板函數不能有任何回傳值</p>"], ["C", "<p>虛函數只能出現在類別模板之中</p>"], ["D", "<p>成員函數模板一律被視為 static</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>虛函數表無法預先列出所有實例化版本</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>虛函數表要列出每個虛函數的確切位址；函數模板可能被任意多種型態實例化，編譯器無法事先建立表格。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-5-1", "sid": "s9-5", "sec": "9.5 模板的編譯：為什麼放在標頭檔", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "模板放標頭檔", "stem": "<p>為什麼函數模板的定義通常要寫在標頭檔，而不是像一般函數一樣放在 .cpp？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>模板本身不是程式碼，只有在某個編譯單元中用具體型態實例化時，編譯器才會產生程式碼，而實例化需要看到模板的完整定義。若定義只放在另一個 .cpp，使用端編譯時看不到定義，無法實例化；定義所在的 .cpp 又沒有人要求它產生該型態的版本，最後連結時找不到函數。把定義放在標頭檔，每個使用的檔案都看得到定義，就能各自實例化；另一種做法是在 .cpp 中做顯式實例化。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-6-1", "sid": "s9-6", "sec": "9.6 可變參數模板與模板模板參數", "kind": "預測輸出", "level": "中", "title": "參數包", "stem": "<p>下面程式印出什麼？</p>\n<div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">template</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"k\">typename</span><span class=\"p\">...</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"p\">...)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">...(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"p\">);</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"k\">template</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"k\">typename</span><span class=\"p\">...</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">auto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prod</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"p\">...</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">...);</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'a'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">2.5</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">prod</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><pre class=\"out\" data-title=\"執行結果\"><code>0 3 24</code></pre></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>sizeof...(T) 是參數包中型態的個數；(x * ...) 是折疊表達式，把所有參數相乘：2 × 3 × 4 = 24。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch09", "id": "q-s9-7-1", "sid": "s9-7", "sec": "9.7 綜合範例：泛型的數值工具", "kind": "簡答", "level": "難", "title": "模板參數 vs std::function", "stem": "<p>第 5 章的二分法用 <code>const std::function&lt;double(double)&gt; &amp;f</code> 當參數，這裡的牛頓法用模板參數 <code>F f</code>。兩種做法各有什麼優缺點？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>std::function 是一個固定的型態，任何可呼叫物件都會被包裝成它，函數本身不必是模板、可以放在 .cpp 分離編譯，也能在執行期存進容器、動態替換；代價是有型態抹除的額外成本，呼叫時無法內聯。模板參數 F 讓編譯器知道確切的型態，對每種 lambda 各實例化一份，呼叫可以被內聯，效率最好；代價是函數必須寫在標頭檔、每種型態都產生一份程式碼，錯誤訊息也較難讀。</p></div>", "ch": "第 9 章　模板與泛型"}, {"p": "ch10", "id": "q-s10-1-1", "sid": "s10-1", "sec": "10.1 整學期的地圖", "kind": "選擇", "level": "易", "title": "關鍵字的用途", "stem": "<p>在一個 <code>Money</code> 類別的單參數建構函數加上 <code>explicit</code>，主要是為了防止什麼？</p>", "key": "B", "opts": [["A", "<p>Money 物件被任意複製</p>"], ["B", "<p>數字被偷偷轉換成 Money</p>"], ["C", "<p>Money 被其他類別繼承</p>"], ["D", "<p>Money 的成員被外界修改</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (B)</strong><p>數字被偷偷轉換成 Money</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>explicit 禁止單參數建構函數被用來做隱式轉換，例如 <code>pay(250)</code> 自動把 250 變成 Money。</p></div>", "ch": "第 10 章　課程總結：從語法到量化程式庫"}, {"p": "ch10", "id": "q-s10-3-1", "sid": "s10-3", "sec": "10.3 自己寫一個迷你 QuantLib", "kind": "選擇", "level": "中", "title": "update 的責任", "stem": "<p>在 LazyObject 的設計中，<code>update()</code> 被呼叫時應該做什麼？</p>", "key": "A", "opts": [["A", "<p>只標記目前的結果已經過期</p>"], ["B", "<p>立刻重新計算一次最新的價格</p>"], ["C", "<p>把這個物件從記憶體中刪除</p>"], ["D", "<p>把最新算好的 NPV 回傳出去</p>"]], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案 (A)</strong><p>只標記目前的結果已經過期</p></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>update 只負責把 calculated_ 設為 false、標記狀態；真正的計算延到下次有人呼叫 NPV() 時才做，避免市場資料頻繁變動時做大量沒人需要的計算。</p></div>", "ch": "第 10 章　課程總結：從語法到量化程式庫"}, {"p": "ch10", "id": "q-s10-3-2", "sid": "s10-3", "sec": "10.3 自己寫一個迷你 QuantLib", "kind": "簡答", "level": "中", "title": "mutable 的必要", "stem": "<p>為什麼 <code>calculated_</code> 與 <code>npv_</code> 要宣告成 <code>mutable</code>？</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><p>NPV() 是「讀取結果」的介面，邏輯上不改變物件的狀態，所以宣告為 const 成員函數，好讓 const 物件或 const 參考也能呼叫。但 NPV() 內部可能需要重新計算並更新快取（npv_）與旗標（calculated_），const 成員函數本來不能修改成員變數，所以這兩個成員要宣告為 mutable：它們屬於快取這種「不影響物件邏輯狀態」的內部細節。</p></div>", "ch": "第 10 章　課程總結：從語法到量化程式庫"}, {"p": "ch10", "id": "q-s10-3-3", "sid": "s10-3", "sec": "10.3 自己寫一個迷你 QuantLib", "kind": "寫程式", "level": "難", "title": "多一個觀察者", "stem": "<p>在上面的程式中，新增一張 10 年期、票面利率 2% 的債券，共用同一條曲線；報價從 2% 改成 3% 後，印出兩張債券的 NPV 與各自的計算次數，驗證一次報價變動會同時讓兩張債券過期。（main 以外的程式不需修改，只要寫出 main 的內容。）</p>", "key": "", "opts": [], "sol": "<div class=\"ans\"><strong>答案</strong><div class=\"code\"><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"複製程式碼\">複製</button><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><pre><code><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">auto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">make_shared</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">SimpleQuote</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">auto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">make_shared</span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">FlatCurve</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">FixedRateBond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.03</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">FixedRateBond</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b10</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">100</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">curve</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b5</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NPV</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b10</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NPV</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rate</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">setValue</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">0.03</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b5</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NPV</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b10</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">NPV</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b5</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">calcCount</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\" \"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b10</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">calcCount</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\">// 都是 2</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"why\"><p class=\"sh\">解析</p><p>兩張債券都向曲線註冊為觀察者，曲線再向報價註冊；報價變動時曲線轉發通知，兩張債券都被標記為過期，各自在下次讀取時重算一次。</p></div>", "ch": "第 10 章　課程總結：從語法到量化程式庫"}]};